<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">- Chuyo Bible Translation</book>
  <para style="usfm">3.0</para>
  <para style="ide">65001 - Unicode (UTF-8)</para>
  <para style="h">MARK</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mark keq Goxpaq Jesu Khrista Gaanrangx Komei</para>
  <para style="toc2">Mark</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mrk</para>
  <para style="mt1">MARK</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mark keq Goxpaq Jesu Khristaq Gaanrangx Komei</para>
  <para style="imt">Jonggangx</para>
  <para style="im">
    <char style="bk">Mark keq Goxpaq Jesu Khristaq Gaanrangx Komei</char> nox laiqpenq begix mong maoq jaqleq korenq paq ganglüm maq Jesu agang jux günqleq tiü. Gaga jaqjaq tox, “Tamran komei,” leq nyarkkuq. Gatoq leppoq nox, “Gaanrangx Komei.” Gagaram nox Jesu rix pheimaq gox ü, Matthew, Mark, Luke geithungteq John. Mark keq goxpaq Gaanrangx komei laiqnox Gaanrangx komei laiqpenq begix mong maoq setoh-paq lhang. Jesu khrista rixyuq manqphei maoq ganglüoq 65–70 maq rappoq Gaanrangx komei mong maoq kogangxpaq laiqleq tingx. Seloiq-ü tingxpuqmanxpaq ram meq teith aganox Romx maq tipaq khristaram mongboh athuq leixmaq Romx maq gox ü laiqleq günq.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mark to, John Mark lebix tingx, kunox lümpaq Paul ji Banabas nyix phi komei goiqpaq lhangleq thibabix kum missionary ya kamq juxmaq ko mong thamxgünqna koh (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 13:13">Lümp 13.13</ref></char>). Gapheimaq anyixyu pamaq Mark Banabas phix kamq (<char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 15:37-39">Lümp 15.37–39</ref></char>). Mark nox Peter phibix meilang koshoh goiqpaq komeileq tingxnguq (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1PE 1:13">1 Pet 1.13</ref></char>). Thitux mabix Mark nox Jesu Khrista agang to mik ngant panox mantlhang, Manxpuqyangpaq rammeq kapponox Mark keq siloiq leq nox Peter gimaoq tamxranx manxneq gax Gaanrangx komei Mark laiq nox lhangnguq. Gaanrangx komei Mark laiq mong maq, yingxngoq nox samsaram ji Jesu weq kokaxpaq nyih leixmaq nüopaq.</para>
  <para style="iot">Kohungnyuqwax Tipaq</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Mark keq ko laiq koke gangpaq <char style="ior">(<ref loc="MRK 1:1-13">1.1–13</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">2. Geithungteq, Galilee maq Jesu weq thaothoqpaq Mark keq günq <char style="ior">(<ref loc="MRK 1:14-8:21">1.14—8.21</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">3. Gapheimaq ku weq Jesu Jerusalem to pei-ü jux günq <char style="ior">(<ref loc="MRK 8:22-10:52">8.22—10.52</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">4. Jerusalem maoq jux, geithungteq Jesu rixpaq ji Gangleq leihpaq jux, Mark keq goxleq ranx. <char style="ior">(<ref loc="MRK 11:1-16:8">11.1—16.8</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1" />
  <para style="s">Baptixpaq John neq Honxnüoqpaq</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Matthew 3.1–12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luke 3.1–18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">John 1.19–28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1" />Aganox Younggan kosaq,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kokao lhakgoxlaiq maq </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Aganox Younggan kosaq, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">thepaq mantteix.</char></note> Jesu Khrista Gaanrangx komei koke gangpaq. <verse eid="MRK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2" />Isaiah Ashipaq e gox ü wenneq kojong gang:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">“Younggan neq günq, ‘Koiyeq naq thaoyuh kar monxtanxpaq jaq pongxngaox.’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:2">Ku weq naq ginlhakkax lüm manxsingxngaox.<verse eid="MRK 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3" />Phehphoyo maq chingqgark gingx jeiq ye günq,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:3">‘Taihungpaq ginlhakkax lüm singxngantx,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 1:3">ku kamq mathu lüm yungyak le shingxngantx!’ ”<verse eid="MRK 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4" />Phehphoyo maq John ngai, khüonyak ram to baptix koh, geithungteq kuweq honxnüoq.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.4 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Phehphoyo maq John ngai, khüonyak ram to baptix koh, geithungteq kuweq honxnüoq; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kokao lhakgox laiq </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Phehphoyomaq Baptixpa John ngai, gama honxnüoq, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">leq tiü leq titao.</char></note> Kuweq khüonyakram to agaunxneq, “Nümx mong labpenx, geithungteq baptixleq koh.” “Geithuphi Younggan neq nümx konyux jarkleq phakeo” leq günq. <verse eid="MRK 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5" />Judea Gaankamx Jerusalem chingqnyuq maq tipaq khüonyak ram John neq nüopaq ngaox tanxnaxleq pei. Kummeq konyux chanx nungteq, Jordan sungxyinx maq kumtoq baptix leq koh.<verse eid="MRK 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6" />John neq mokmun khuq gunx gettaq maixkhon get git, geithungteq ko tamqmax Yukmon ji nyahsa jie shah. <verse eid="MRK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7" />Ku weq khüonyak ram to agaunxneq chingqgark leq honxnüoq, “Koi yeq bamleq ku lhaqlop guq yaox zorwaq hangoi paq kar phi gongx sibohpaq kar pheimaq jaq peiyao. <verse eid="MRK 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8" />Koiyeq nümx to jie maq gale baptix pha ü, geithibao kuweq nümx to lhasaq koyaoq phi baptix leq” pha keox.<verse eid="MRK 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Baptix Geithungteq Tokpaq</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-4:11">Matthew 3.13—4.11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21">Luke 3.21</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 3:22">22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">4.1–13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9" />Gapaq nyih ji ginlhak angtan maq Galilee Gankamx maq tipaq Nazareth mao Jesu pei, geithungteq Jordan sungx maq John neq kum baptix leq koh. <verse eid="MRK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10" />Jie manneq Jesu ngaiphe goihleq angkhüo zap paq kuweq ngantx geithuphi kogah maq yungx ao unxneq tipaq koyaoq lhasaq peipaq ngantx. <verse eid="MRK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:17">Mat 3.17</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:18">12.18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:7">Mrk 9.7</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:22">Luk 3.22</ref></char></note>Geithungteq angkhüo manneq ngaox jaq pei, “Naq kar monglungxsaq kar saq, koi yeq naq to mong oungtao” leq günqpaq ngaox tanxtao.<verse eid="MRK 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12" />Peileix e gaanzangx ka koyaoq lhaxsa e ku goix leq paox; <verse eid="MRK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13" />Geithungteq ku phehphoyo maq nyih gowkbegix yaox ngoi ye leq kaishih e tokjilei leq jong. Gama phaoq rünmok ram bix teix, geithibabix angkhüo monxtanx ram peileq kotoq taoh.<verse eid="MRK 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu weq Nyahpaqram Begix Nyark</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-22">Matthew 4.12–22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14">Luke 4.14</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 4:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">5.1–11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14" />Aleq tenxkamp maq John tenx pheimaq Galilee Gankamx to Jesu pei geithungteq Younggan mao Gaanrangx komei honxnüoq. <verse eid="MRK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:2">Mat 3.2</ref></char></note>“Kuweq that paq ginlhak pei taga, geithuphi Younggan angchingq ngoi taga. Nümx konyux manneq monglab tah geithungteq Gaanrangx komei to koyingx teihlah” leq günq.<verse eid="MRK 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16" />Aleq Galilee sungxyinx jen maq Jesu leq jux maq ku weq nyahpa anyix, Simon ji konao Andrew sungx maq showx phi nyah laoqleq ngantx. <verse eid="MRK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17" />“Kar phei to goix kei, geithungteq koi yeq nümx to khüonyak kappaqthuq nüo pha khah” leq Jesu weq kum to günq. <verse eid="MRK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18" />Peileix e kum meq showx tahoungteq kopheito goix.<verse eid="MRK 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19" />Geithuphix ku sisa koxleq kamq juxmaq, Zebedee kosaq James ji konao John nyix lekhung maq kum showx manxsingx leq ngantx. <verse eid="MRK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20" />Kuweq kum ngantxnu phi goih e Jesu weq kum to nyark, geithuphi kum kopaq Zebedee nyahlhüoh a leq ginlhak shakpaqram phi lekhung maq tah oungteq Jesu pheito goix.<verse eid="MRK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Konyux Lhasaq Phu Khüonyakpaq Jaq</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:31-37">Luke 4.31–37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21" />Geithungteq kum Capernaum chingqnyuq to pei, geithuphi jampaq Sabbath maq Jesu beehaihkamp to zongq geithungteq honxnüoq a kokegangq. <verse eid="MRK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:28">Mat 7.28</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 7:29">29</ref></char></note>Aopangq khüonyak rammeq ko ngaox tanx kuweq nüopa ngantnungteq khampungxlob. Chamleixma thibaq kuweq ngaoxhung nüoparam münxneq halhang e kuweq gongx tileq nüo.<verse eid="MRK 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23" />Gajuxmaq oh le ku maq konyux lhasaq phux khüonyak jaq beehaihkamp manneq ngaix geithungteq chingqgark, <verse eid="MRK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24" />“Nazareth mao Jesu, komx mao nangq nge champhangx lah a tux ü? Komx mahleq jarkkaq naq agamaq pei-ü jea? Naq aoleq koi yeq tingxtao. Naq koyaoq Younggan monxtanxpaq” leq günq.<verse eid="MRK 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25" />Geithibaoq Jesu weq lhasaq to, “Roothabeih, geithungteq khüonyak manneq ngaitah” leq shihleq günq.<verse eid="MRK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26" />Konyux lhaxsaq e kotoq meilang leq hex, geithungteq chingqgark leq günq. Gapheimaq ko manneq ngai. <verse eid="MRK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27" />Khüonyak ram rappoq khampungxlob geithungteq kum bamaq aga unxne ging ji günq, “Aga champhang? nüopa korünq geithungteq gongx tipaq jaq lhangga! Aga khüonyak maq konyux lhaxsaq to ngaoxhung koh athuq gongx titao; Geithungteq kum meq ko ngaox maq lahtao,” leq jaqjaq to henx ji günq.<verse eid="MRK 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28" />Gaga a lhangleq Galilee kahgan rappoq maq Jesu gaanrangx peileix e pongx.<verse eid="MRK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu weq Khüonyakram Meilang leq Mei leq Koh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Matthew 8.14–17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luke 4.38–41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29" />Jesu geithungteq ko Samsaram beehaihkamp manneq yan geithungteq James ji John kumphi goih e Simon ji Andrew Kamp to nyap. <verse eid="MRK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30" />Simon konyiq chunxhex kakleq lay maq gay leq teix, geithuphi gaga ngaox peileix e Jesu to kum meq günq. <verse eid="MRK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31" />Gaga nya jenka ku ra, ganya lhak maq sheatleq ganya ronx leq rüoqwa koh. Chunxhex kakkeq ganya zanxleq tah, geithuphix kuweq kum to taoh leq koh.<verse eid="MRK 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32" />Mojuxmaq gunxpongx ngoi, angtan nyep pheimaq khüonyak ram meq Jesu geto Kakpaqram meilang leq lhahboq tipaqram lahleq pei. <verse eid="MRK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33" />Geithuphi chingqnyuq maq tipaq khüonyak ram rap leq lungkax jong ngoi yeq leq heih. <verse eid="MRK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34" />Kak kogenq mamaxlümx tipaq meilang leq Jesu weq meiqleq koh, geithungteq lhahboq ram meilangleq changx leq paox. Lhahboq rammeq kotoq jajage günqna hakoh Chamleixma thiba ku ao ngeihleq kummeq tingx.<verse eid="MRK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu weq Galilee maq Honxnüoq</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 4:42-44">Luke 4.42–44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35" />Jampaq nüp nüpnyingq angngai thaoq maq Jesu rüoq geithungteq Kamp manneq paox; Geithungteq Nok manneq yanleq paoleq zangqpaq lung maq kuweq angphung. <verse eid="MRK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36" />Geithungteq Simon ji Ko goipaq rammeq bix ku lümq maq paox; <verse eid="MRK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37" />Geithuphi mojuxmaq kum meq ku ngant, “Khüonyak ram rappoiyeq naq lümq leq tiga” leq kum meq günq.<verse eid="MRK 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38" />Geithibaoq Jesu weq kum to lox, “Kim ngeihmaq tipaq amungq nokram to paoxwaox. Koi yeq kum to honxnüoq waox, Chamleixmaq thiba gathat taga leq kar pei ü” leq kum to günq.<verse eid="MRK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.39 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 4:23">Mat 4.23</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 9:35">9.35</ref></char>
    </note>Gajux maq Galilee Gaankamx rappoq mao, beehaihkamp to peile honxnüoq geithungteq konyux lhahboq changx leq ku kamq.<verse eid="MRK 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu weq Ngon Kak Mei leq Koh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Matthew 8.1–4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luke 5.12–16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40" />Angonpaq jaq Jesu geto pei geithuphi bamleq yop ji khumq leq kotoq tüohphaleq günq, Jesu weq agaunxneq günq, “Nangqngeq lung banox koi yeq tuhleq jarkkaq zokkaox”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.40 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">tuhleq jarkkaq zokkaox: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Khüonyak jamaoq aga ngonkak nox kum banqlüm maq hayaoqpaq le teihtaoq.</char></note> leq kuweq günq.<verse eid="MRK 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41" />Jesu weq kotoq meilang leq yoyoleq<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.41 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">yoyoleq; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kokao lhakgoxlaiq </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">mongkhah, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">u leq titao.</char></note> tux, geithungteq kojenka raq geithungteq kotoq tamx. Kuweq aga unxneq lox, “Koiyeq tuh leq jark kaq tue tao, naq yaoqtah!” leq günq. <verse eid="MRK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42" />Gajuxmaq peileix ye khüonyakpaq mao ngon kak tuh leq yaoq. <verse eid="MRK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43" />Gapheimaq Jesu weq kotoq gongx phi ngaox kohleq günqnungteq leih a koh. <verse eid="MRK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44" />Kotoq aga unxneq günq, “Tanxnanx, amungq aoto bix aga saqkiq thagünq geithibaoq yungyak leihleq nümx Gamxpaq to tux a kohunx, gapheimaq naq ngon yaoqtataoleq tingxngathuq ginlhakkax Mosa ngaoxhung maq tipaq unxneq shomx ji tou wenx” leq kuweq günq.<verse eid="MRK 1:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45" />Geithibaoq khüonyakpaq yanleq paox geithungteq pangqyungxmaq honxnüoq leq kuweq pangaq ngaox yanx nuleima Chingqthaoq to Jesu pei ya hazok. Peikhathu leimaq gaanzangx maq ku jong geithuphi pangqyungx mao khüonyakram paq kogi maq heih ji pei.<verse eid="MRK 1:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2" />
  <para style="s">Kaojarixkak Khüonyak Jaq Jesu weq meileq Koh.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Matthew 9.1–8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luke 5.17–26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1" />Monyih gonxje yanleq pao oungteq Capernaum chingqnyuq to Jesu nongleq leih, geithuphi ku Kamp maq titaoleq khüonyak rammeq ngaox tanx. <verse eid="MRK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2" />Gapheimaq Kamp khamaq geithungteq lungkax jongmaq peiyeqleq lhaqnak nyoix hatiyeqleq khüonyak ram meilang leq heih, gajux maq Jesu weq kum to laiq ngaox nüo; <verse eid="MRK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3" />Mojuxmaq khüonyak ram kokao pei ü ngant gaga unxneq khüonyak begix ye kaojariekak kakpaq jaq paileq pei. <verse eid="MRK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4" />Geithibabix khüonyak loiqyuleiqmaq kummeq Jesu geto gapaq lahleq pei a hazok. Geithuyaoxwe Jesu jongleq tipaq phi shaokhahleq kummeq kamptok lao. Geithungteq kummeq kakpaq züm phi yaxleq koh. <verse eid="MRK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5" />Mojuxmaq kum koyingx teihpaq ngant geithuphi kaojariekak kakpaq to Jesuweq günq, “Kar saq, naq konyux jarkpheingeih.”<verse eid="MRK 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6" />Gajuxmaq ngaoxhung nüoparam kokao bix jongleq teix geithuphi kum lhongx lhongx kah aga unxneq teih, <verse eid="MRK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7" />“Agapaq khüonyakkeq champhang günqnu ngeih? Kuweq phohjihaiyungtao! Younggan halhangba aobix konyux jarkkaq mant zok!”<verse eid="MRK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8" />Kummeq cham teih Jesu weq ko lhaxsaq maq peileix yeq tingx, geithungteq kuweq kum to günq; “Nümx mongkha maq gaga unxne chaammax teih ü? <verse eid="MRK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9" />Kaojariekakpaq to ‘naq konyux jarkpheingeih’ leq günqpaq senyaiyaq jea, geihalhangba ‘rüoqtah, naq züm pailah geithungteq kaamq tah’ leq günqpaq simeiyax? <verse eid="MRK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10" />Geithibaoq kahgannyuq mao konyux jark zokkathuq, khüonyak kosaq maq gongx tiganyixleq nümxmeq tingxngax thuq ginlhakkax” kuweq kaojariekakpaq to günq, <verse eid="MRK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11" />“Koiyeq naq to günq nungeih, rüoqtah, naq züm pailah geithungteq Kamp ka leihtah!”<verse eid="MRK 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12" />Kum rappeq tuxleq tijuxmaq, gapaq khüonyak rüoq, ku züm pai, geithungteq nanneq Kamp ka leih. Kum rap leq meilangleq khampungxlob geithungteq Younggan to münxboh koh, leq aleq günq, “kommeq aga unxneq tipaq jajage jamqmoq ngant!”<verse eid="MRK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu weq Levi Nyark</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Matthew 9.9–13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luke 5.27–32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13" />Jesu Chambix Galilee gotnyu nahka leih. Benyuqsaq kogimaq pei, geithuphi ku weq kum to honxnüoq kokigang. <verse eid="MRK 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14" />Ku kamleq tijuxmaq, Alphaeus kosaq Levi heixhaiq jongpaq pümmaq jongleq, kuweq ngant. Jesu weq kotoq günq, “Kar pheitoq goixkei” Levi yong leq ko pheito goix.<verse eid="MRK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15" />Gapheimaq Levi Kamp maq<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.15 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Levi Kamp maq; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">geihalhangba </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ku nox (gaganox Jesu) Kamp maq.</char></note> Jesu weq tamqshah. Heixhaiqpaq ram geithungteq konyux ram Jesu pheitoq goixleq meilangleq teix, geithungteq kum meilangleq geithungteq ko Samsaram bix goih e jong. <verse eid="MRK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16" />Mojuxmaq ngaoxhung nüoparam kokao aopangq pharase rammaq lhangleq teix, kummeq konyuxram geithungteq heixhaiqpaq ram phi Jesu weq goih shahpaq ngant; geithuphi kummeq Samsaram to kih, “Chamleima kuweq heixhaiqpaq ram phi geithungteq konyux khüonyakram phi shah ü?”<verse eid="MRK 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17" />Mojuxmaq Jesu weq kum ngaox tanx, geithungteq kum to günq; “Ameimaq tipaq khüonyak rammeq kaktuxpaq chammamantlah, geithibaoq aopangq kakkuq ngeihleq garam ginlhakkax kopong. Shaokhahleq tiparam nyark ka mant lhang, geithibaoq konyux ram ginlhakkax ka pei.”<verse eid="MRK 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hashah Nanxpaq jux Kihpaq</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Matthew 9.14–17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luke 5.33–39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18" />Aleq Baptixpa John Samsaram geithungteq Pharase ram hashah e nanxneq, khüonyak kokao Jesu geto peile kih, “Chamleima Baptixpa John Samsaram ji pharase ram hashah e nanxneq, geithibabix naq samsaram meq chamleima hananxnuq?”<verse eid="MRK 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19" />Jesu weq kum to lox, “Naolhapoix aorayx maq pei paq toixpa kogoiqpaq ram hashah jong ngajea?” Toix paq kumphi goih e tiphei maq ngaleq mant jong. <verse eid="MRK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20" />Geithibaoq ginlhak jaq peiyaox mojuxmaq toix paq kum manneq lahleq paoxwaoxngeih, gajux maq kumbix hashah e nanxnaox.<verse eid="MRK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21" />“Lhaklop korangq maq khuq koren aobix mant sing, gale naamleq sing banox koren singpaq korangqbeq nangleq shinqnaox. <verse eid="MRK 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22" />Geihalhangba kokao weq gureakjie koren müixkhonx jick, korangq maq shoq banox gureak korenneq müixkhonx jick phuppaox, geithungteq gureakjie koren ji müixkhonx kokhon moinyeleq gennaox. Mant lhang, müixkhonx jick korennox gureakjie koren ginlhakkax!” ngeihleq günq.<verse eid="MRK 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sabbath jux Kihpaq</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Matthew 12.1–8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luke 6.1–5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23" />Sabbath jaq maq Jesu kah lenxleq kaamleq leq, ko pheito goipaq ko Samsaram meq tahreak yut leq lah a gang. <verse eid="MRK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24" />Geithuphi pharase ram meq Jesu to aleq günq, “Tuxwen, Sabbath ngaoxhung phi hajampa kummeq chaammax ringqngu!”<verse eid="MRK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25" />Jesu weq lox, “Ku weq shah a thuq kopongngax lhangjuxmaq David teq cham ringq nümx me iexleq günq ya? Ku geithungteq kophux ram nonxnga, <verse eid="MRK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26" />Geithuphi Younggan Kamp to ku pei geithungteq Younggan ginlhakkax kohpaq unxneq ku weq shah. Gaga paq Abiathar eikhung Gamxpaqaq tijuxmaq ngai ü. Kum ngaoxhung maq Gamxpaq ram meq gale günq paq unxneq shah ü, geithibabix David teq gaga shah, geithungteq ko goiparam to yaox koh.”<verse eid="MRK 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27" />Geithungteq ku weq kum to günq, “Sabbath nox khüonyak ginlhakkax ringqnguqngeih, Sabbath ginlhakkax khüonyak ringqngu mantlhangq. <verse eid="MRK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28" />Geithuyaoxwe Khüonyak kosaq nox Sabbath ginlhak kabix Taihungpaq ngeih.”<verse eid="MRK 2:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3" />
  <para style="s">Kao ja Rixkak Lhak Phux Khüonyak Jesu weq Sabbath Nyih Meiqleq Koh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Matthew 12.9–14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luke 6.6–11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1" />Gapheimaq Jesu beeheihkamp to leih, geithuphi gama lhak kaojariekak phux khüonyak jaaleq tei. <verse eid="MRK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2" />Sabbath maq khüonyak Kaojariekak kak meileq kohyaleq tuxle Jesu to komox ringqngaleq khüonyak kokao meilang küntingphex tuxle jongleq tei. <verse eid="MRK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3" />Lhak Kaojariekak leq tipaq khüonyak to Jesu weq günq, “Bee mohthao maq yongqnganx.” <verse eid="MRK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4" />Gapheimaq ku weq khüonyak ram to kih, “Kim ngaoxhung maq Sabbath maq jamphangx ringqnganx leq günqpaq tiu? kogenq ringqnga ji komei ringqngax khüonyak agang jaq gangngax koh a ji langxngax?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 3:4">Geithibabi kummeq ngaox pha jaq yaox bix ha ngaix. <verse eid="MRK 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5" />Kum to tux leq pongxngungte Jesu meilang mongkhah ngaix geithebaoq gajuxmaqwoleq kum mong teih hatipaq ji hashao paq ngantleq ku yoyoleq teih. Gapheimaq khüonyak to Jesu weq günq lhak chin nanx, ku weq ko lhak chin geithuphi mei. <verse eid="MRK 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6" />Pharase ram beeheihkamp ma e nanneq yanleq paox. Geithungteq nanneq Herod Samqsaqram phi pong geithungteq Jesu langxngax thuleixmaq honxjimanx lümq.<verse eid="MRK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gotnyu Jenmaq Beenyusaq</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7" />Jesu geithungteq ko Samqsaqram Galilee gotnyu nahka pao, geithuphix khüonyak meilang ko pheito goix. Kum Galilee gankamx mao, Judea gaankamx mao, <verse eid="MRK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8" />Jerusalem mao Idumea longqgeq pongx mao Jordan longqgeq mao Sidon ji Tyre chingqnyuq kümxpaq namqpaq mao pei, ku e ringqpaq monxthaoq kummeq tantleq khüonyak meilang Jesu geto pei. <verse eid="MRK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.9,10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 4:1">Mrk 4.1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-3">Luk 5.1–3</ref></char></note>Beenyu meilang loiq khüonyak rammeq kotoq ha kungqngathuq leimaq; geithungteq ku Samqsaqram to lekhungsaq jaq singx phaleq Jesu e günq. <verse eid="MRK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10" />Chemleimathibaq ku weq khüonyak ram meilangle meiqleq koh, geithungteq kakpaq ram rap kum to tamxmathuq ginlhakkax kum to tamx phaleq jajatoq singleq pei. <verse eid="MRK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11" />Geithuphix mojux maq kummaq tipaq konyux lhasaq ram me ku ngant, ko muhthaoqmaq lhaqkuh shungxleq bam, geithungteq jingqgark, “Naq Younggan kosaq!”<verse eid="MRK 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12" />Geithibabi aongeihle hagünna thuq ginlhakkax konyux lhasaq to Jesu weq ngaoxhung gongqleq koh.<verse eid="MRK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu weq Lümparam Banxbaanyix Sheiq</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Matthew 10.1–4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luke 6.12–16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13" />Gapheimaq Jesu kahtoq to zongq, geithungteq ku e nyark a tuepa khüonyak ram kogitoq pei, geithuphi kogitoq pei; <verse eid="MRK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14" />Geithungteq ku weq banxbaanyix sheiq, kum to Lümparamleq münx. Ku e kum to günq, “Nümx ka phe jongnga koi e nümx sheiq u ngeih” “Honxnüo wa thuq ginlhakkabi koi yeq nümx paoxwaox”. <verse eid="MRK 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15" />Geithungteq konyux lhasaq jangxleq paoxwathuq gongx nümxmaq tiyaox.<verse eid="MRK 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16" />Ku weq rünqpaq Lümparam aga ram lhangnguq; Simon (Jesu e kutoq Peter leqbix münx); <verse eid="MRK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17" />Zebedee kosaq James ji konao John (Jesu e ko nyix to Boanerges le münx koh, lebpu “angmok saqram”). <verse eid="MRK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18" />Andrew, Philip, Bartholomew, Matthew, Thomas, Alphaeus kosaq James, Thaddaeus, Canaan mao Simon. <verse eid="MRK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19" />Geithungteq Judas Iscariot ku tangngaxthupaq.<verse eid="MRK 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Geithungteq Beelzebul</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-32">Matthew 12.22–32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luke 11.14–23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:10">12.10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20" />Gapheimaq Jesu Kamp to leih. Chaambex khüonyak meilang le heih; Jesu geithungteq ko Samqsaqram tamq shah ginlhak yaox ha tak. <verse eid="MRK 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21" />Mojuxmaq ko kaixkaoq rammeq gangaox tanx, ku kapleq thammaqthuq ginlhakkax kum yong, chemleimathibaq “ku mong pomtaga” leq khüonyak rammeq günq.<verse eid="MRK 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.22 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 9:34">Mat 9.34</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:15">10.15</ref></char>
    </note>Geithuphi Jerusalem chingqnyuq manneq yuxpaq ngaoxhung nüoparam kokao weq aleq günq, “ko maq Beelzebul ti u lhangga! Amungq rammeq günq, aga nox lhahboq angngampaq, aoweq kotoq kum jangx ngathuq gongx koh”.<verse eid="MRK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23" />Geithuphix Jesu weq kogitoq khüonyak ram nyark, geithungteq kumtoq ngaox leppumaq günq, “Kaishih e beiq yanxneq kaishih to changx zokka? <verse eid="MRK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24" />Angchingq jawo tantleq tojipan banox gaga angchingq mongle mantjong zokkaox. <verse eid="MRK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25" />Geithungteq kaixkaoq jawo tojipanle tantleq ngaibano garam kaixkaoq mongle mantjong zokkaox. <verse eid="MRK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26" />Geithuyaox we kaishihram angchingq jawo kenxleq tantleq ngaibano mongle mantjong zok, geithibao hop ji humq le koka ngoiyao.<verse eid="MRK 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27" />“Aoweqbex ku e agangnga gongxtipaq khüonyak laoqleq khaxleq hathamq banox, gongx tipaq khüonyak Kamp mao monx chinxle lah a mant nyap zokkaox”.<verse eid="MRK 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28" />Koyingx maq koi e nümx to günnuq khüonyak rammeq konyux rappoq, geithungteq ngaoxgen kum me günqpaq<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.28 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ngaoxgen kum me günqpaq; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">geihalhangba </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Younggan phe tokteile kum me ngaox kogenq ganbabex.</char></note> rappuq ginlhakkax konyux jarkkaq zokkaox. <verse eid="MRK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:10">Luk 12.10</ref></char></note>Geithibao aoweq lhasaq koyaoq to phojihaile tokjiteile ngaox genq günq, mojux mabix konyux mant jark zokkaox; chemleimathibaq ku weq kobakhatipa konyux ommungtao. <verse eid="MRK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30" />Chemleimathibaq kum kokao e “komaq konyux lhasaq titaoleq günq, geithuphi Jesu weq aga günq.”<verse eid="MRK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Konyuq ji Konaoram</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Matthew 12.46–50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luke 8.19–21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31" />Gapheimaq Jesu Konyuq ji Konao ram pei, geithungteq kum Kamp thaoka youngleq jong, geithungteq khüonyak ram kokao pongxleq kotoq günq. <verse eid="MRK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32" />Chemleimathibaq kotoq ngeihle khüonyak meilangle jongleq tei, geithuphe kummeq kotoq günq, “Tuxwen naq nyu ji naq nao ram Kamp thaomaq tiga, geithungteq kummeq naq lamqleq tiga”.<verse eid="MRK 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33" />Jesu weq lox, “ka nyuq aola? geihalhangba ka nao ram aopangla?” <verse eid="MRK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34" />Kojen maq jongleq tepaq khüonyak ram to tuxle pongx ngungte günq, “Tuxwen! ka nyuq geithungteq ka naoram agamaq titao. <verse eid="MRK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35" />Chemleimathibaq aopangngeq Youngganpaq e lungnguq monmok, ku ka nao, geithungteq ka nyuq”.<verse eid="MRK 3:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4" />
  <para style="s">Kogi hai-u maq Ngaoxlep paq</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Matthew 13.1–9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luke 8.4–8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 5:1-3">Luk 5.1–3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Chambix Jesu weq Galilee sungx jen maq honxnüoqaq gangx. Kum kotoq ngeihle heihpaq khüonyak meilangle loiq u leimaq ku lekhung jaq to zongq geithungteq jie maq yong. Heihpaq khüonyak rapleq fanxtanxka jong. <verse eid="MRK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2" />Kum to honxnüoq juxmaq Ku weq ngaoxlep meilang om, geithungteq aleq günq:<verse eid="MRK 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3" />“Tanxnanx! kogi haixpaja kogi hai a kaq. <verse eid="MRK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4" />Gaga unxne ku e kah maq kogi haiq Juxmaq, kogi kokao lümkonx maq shüt, geithuphe ang aosaq ram peile tonqleq bak. <verse eid="MRK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5" />Shahgeq kokao kagan komei hatipaq longqkhaoq ka shüt. Kagan komei halhangngu yaox e shahgeq nanneq nyem, <verse eid="MRK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6" />Gapheimaq mojux maq angtanneq jark konyemx koileq mah. Chemleimathibaq kukoo harue u leimaq konyemx ghünqle mah. <verse eid="MRK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7" />Kokao shahgeq tuh thamq jongka shüt, tuh thamq youngq le kum lumleq ham geithungteq kummaq koreak hareak zok. <verse eid="MRK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8" />Geithibao shahgeq kokao kahgan meima shüt, geithuphi konyemx meiqleq ngai leq youngq, geithungteq koreak reak: Kokaoq maq gokaram ngoi ye leq, kokaomaq gokagok ngoi ye leq geithungteq kokao maq gokbanx ngoi e koreak reak.”<verse eid="MRK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9" />Geithuphi Jesu e günq, “tanxnathuq, naxkhuh aopangngax tei garammeq tanxlah!”<verse eid="MRK 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngaoxlep Kopongngax Lhangpaq</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Matthew 13.10–17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9">Luke 8.9</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 8:10">10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10" />Mojuxmaq Jesu kojaleq tei, banxbaanyixu samqsaqram ji amungq ku jenmaq tiparammeq ku weq nüopa ngaoxlep khihleq günkeile kotoq henx. <verse eid="MRK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11" />Jesu weq günq, “Younggan angchingmaq champopogi ngaox tingxngax hazokkeq tei nümx to günleq phaphei, geithibao kotokka tipaq amungram to ngaoxlep manneq tanxna koh. <verse eid="MRK 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12" />Geithibabex gale,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">“ ‘Kum meq tux nox tuxwaox,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 4:12">Geithibabix mant nganx naox;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">Kummeq tanx nox tanx naox, geithibabix mant tingngaox.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 4:12">Galehalhang banox kum</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">Younggan geto mong lapkhahthu lhangnguq,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 4:12">Geithuphi kuweq kum to konyux jarkseq lhangnguq.’ ”<verse eid="MRK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kogi Haipa Ngaoxlep Khihleq Günqpaq</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Matthew 13.18–23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luke 8.11–15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13" />Gapheimaq Jesu weq kum to günq, “Nümxmeq gaga ngaox leppoq mant tingxjea? Geithibanox ngaoxlep rappoq nümxmeq beiqyenneq tingxngax? <verse eid="MRK 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14" />Shahgeq haipa e Younggan paq pungüox komei haitao. <verse eid="MRK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15" />Khüonyak kokao nox shahgeq lümkonx maq shüt to unxne tiu; garam khüonyakkeq tanxnuq phi jampmeq Kaishih pei geithungteq kum mao pungüox lah le paox. <verse eid="MRK 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16" />Khüonyak kokao nox kahgan komei hatepaq longq khüomaq shütpaq shahgeq letao. Kum meq Pungüox komei, tanxno phe jampmeq mongmei yuphe lah. <verse eid="MRK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17" />Geithibabix kum mongkha ngoi yeleq rueleq mant thamq geithuphi ginlhak laoqleq mant jong. Geithuphi mojuxmaq pungüox komei leimaq thangxshih pei u ngeihle kummeq shummaq hazokkeq yawaox. <verse eid="MRK 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18" />Amungq khüonyak ram nox tuh thamq jongka shütpaq shahgeq letao. Gaga ramnox aopangngeq pungüox komei tanx, <verse eid="MRK 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19" />Geithibao gaga paq kagannyuq ginlhakkax mongthang, lungngangq to lung geithungteq lungpaq rap teih a koh geithuphi pungüox komei lumleq hamma koh, geithuphe kum kogi hareak. <verse eid="MRK 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20" />Geithibao kahgan komei maq yapaq shahgeq komei to lepponox aopangq khüonyakkeq gaanrangx komei tanx geithungteq lah kokao weq gokaram ngoiyeleq kokao maq gokagok ngoiyeleq geithungteq kokaomaq gokbanx ngoi yeleq koreak reak.”<verse eid="MRK 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kampphang maq Günqjick</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 8:16-18">Luke 8.16–18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mat 5.15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:33">Luk 11.33</ref></char>
    </note>Geithuphi Jesu weq harakkeq günq; “khüonyak kokao weq günqjick pah oungte Kamp mong geihalhangba lay phangka khamqleq jajeiyeq thamya? Günqjick banxpama ku weq banxle hathammaqjea? <verse eid="MRK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:26">Mat 10.26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:2">Luk 12.2</ref></char></note>Chemleimathebaq chempopogi khamqleq thamq kohgah to ngaixleq bakkao, geithungteq jempoqpogeq lumleq thamq gaga halum me hoxwaox. <verse eid="MRK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23" />Nümxmeq tanxnathuq ginlhakkax naxkhuh tebanox tanxnanx!”<verse eid="MRK 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.24 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 7:2">Mat 7.2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:38">Luk 6.38</ref></char>
    </note>Jam Ku weq kum to aga unxne günq; “nümxmeq jemphangx tanx gaga to mong kohunx! nümx me goix ngaox yannathuq ginlhakkax Chempopogi ganglüm lah nümx to ngaox yannathuq ginlhakkax Youngganneq gagogoq lah a pha waw, geithuphi nümx to sehopjinyanpaq yaoxbix baox waox. <verse eid="MRK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:12">Mat 13.12</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 25:29">25.29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:26">Luk 19.26</ref></char></note>Ao khüonyakmaq tei kotoq baoxleq kohaox; aomaq abiseiq yaox mant teileq günq komaq tipaq rap geithungteq abiseiq tipayaox lahleq paoxwao.”<verse eid="MRK 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kogi Youngpaq maq Ngaoxlep</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26" />Jesu weq harakkeq aleq günq: “Younggan angchingq nox khüonyak jeiqyeq ko kahma kogi meilang haipa jaq unxne khüonyak jeiqyeq ko kahma kogi haipa jaq unxne tiu. <verse eid="MRK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27" />Ku angnyak angngaileq nguh geithungteq ku rüoq, haixpaq rap, gaga beiqunneq nyem ji youngngungeihle ku e manttingx. <verse eid="MRK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28" />Kahgan neq konyemx youngleq koh geithungteq koreak reakleq koh; agangnga konyemx ngaix, gapheimaq kokhaoq geithungteq koka a gangxjengoipaq tah reak. <verse eid="MRK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29" />Geithibao mojuxmaq tah reak maan, geithuphi tahhiq jux ngoi u yaox we khüonyakkeq matsaqphiq tahheq kegang.”<verse eid="MRK 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Soiqyan Gemaq Ngaoxlep</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31">Matthew 13.31</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 13:32">32</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 13:34">34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18">Luke 13.18</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 13:19">19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30" />Jesu weq kih, “Younggan angchingq aga unxne tiyaoxle kimmeq jempoqpogeq phi günqna? tingxngaxthuq ginlhakkax kimmeq jempoqpogeq ngaoxlep kimmeq günqna? <verse eid="MRK 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31" />Aganox kahgannyuq mao kogi rappoq phi serippopaq soiqyan ge letao. Khüonyak jeiqyeq lahleq kahma haiq; <verse eid="MRK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32" />Ginlhakseba pheimaq gaga nyem geithungteq konyemx beema seboh opa a lhang komaq kokangq koboh ngai kokangq maq üosaram pei geithungteq kolhak phangmaq korap ringq.”<verse eid="MRK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33" />Gajaq unxne ngaoxlep meilang nguqphix khüonyakram me tingngathuq ginlhakkax Jesu weq honxnüoq. <verse eid="MRK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34" />Ngaoxleppoq hanang nge ku weq kum phi mant gingx, geithibao kum jaq tejuxmaq ko samqsaqram phi gajux khihleq günq.<verse eid="MRK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu weq Lheixnyuq Yingongq Rakkakoh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Matthew 8.23–27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luke 8.22–25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35" />Ganyih mojux maq gunxpongx ngoi Jesu e ko Samqsaqram to aga unxne günq, “kim jalheikaoka toxkhah.” <verse eid="MRK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36" />Kummeq beenyusaq tahoungteq ku jongleq tepaq lekhung khüo to zongq geithuphi amungq lekhung rambex gama tei. <verse eid="MRK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37" />Gajuxmaq meilangle lheixnyu yingongq gongleq pei, Jie loak to pox agieq lekhung ji yeq munxnayax. <verse eid="MRK 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38" />Jesu lekhung keyuh noxrakkaq khüonamx phe nguhle tei, Samqsaqram peile kotoq ronx geithungteq günq, “Honxnüoqpaq kimnox mah oh lhangga, nangqngeq jajage mant teihjea?”<verse eid="MRK 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39" />Jesu rüoq geithungteq lheixnyu yingongq to shihleq günq, “rakkünx!” Geithuphi jie loak to günq, “zangyo jongtah!” Lheixnyu yingongq gingx rakleq ham geithungteq yophoxyapleq mei. <verse eid="MRK 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40" />Gapheimaq Jesu weq kum to günq, “Chemleimaq nümx gapong gax-u? Aleq yaox nümxma koyingxleq teihpaq hatiujea?”<verse eid="MRK 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41" />Geithibao kum meilang gax geithungteq kum jaqjaq to agaunneq günq, “Lheixnyu yingongq je jie loak keyaoxbeq ko ngaoxmaq lah! aga aongeih?”<verse eid="MRK 4:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5" />
  <para style="s">Konyux Lhasaq phux khüonyak jaq Jesu weq Meileq koh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Matthew 8.28–34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luke 8.26–39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1" />Kum Galilee jie kaox Gerasenes ram gaankamx maqpeiq. <verse eid="MRK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2" />Jesu lekhung manneq yu u phi goih e manggom kha manneq ngaipa kogenq lhasaq phux khüonyak jaq kophe pong. Gaga khüonyak maq kogenq lhasaq ram tei. <verse eid="MRK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3" />Ku gunxlungx maq shongq. Aleq aoweq bix ko to yanguq phi khaxleq tham maq hazok; <verse eid="MRK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4" />Chamleima thiba kotoq galomaq lhaq ji lhakmaq yanguq phe khaxleq tham babe, kotoq aogonx khax gaga tütle jark gale yanguq yaox tütpaq lhangnguq phinox ao khüonyak kebex ku lao a hazokkeqleq ku gongx. <verse eid="MRK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5" />Angnyak angngai le ku gunxlungx maq geithungteq phaoq maq chingqgarkleq geithungteq ku weq ko tangtatoq longq nahphi gütleq kaamleq jong.<verse eid="MRK 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6" />Ku sisa koxleq tejuxmaq ku weq Jesu nganx; geithuphe ku phatleq lhaqkuh singleq ko muhthaoq maq bum; <verse eid="MRK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7" />Geithungteq ngaox bohleq chingqgarkle günq, “Jesu eikhungpaq Younggan kosaq! Nangq nge ka mao chem lah a tue ü? Younggan münxmaq koi yeq yop je khumqleq günqnungeih, ka to thangxngax thaphaq!” <verse eid="MRK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8" />Chamleima thiba Jesu weq kotoq, “Kogenq lhasaq agapaq khüonyak manneq paotah” leq günq.<verse eid="MRK 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9" />Jesu weq kotoq, “Naq aoleq münxnuq?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 5:9">Khüonyakkeq lox, “Kar münxnox ‘Mob’ Chamleixma thiba komx meilangle teu!” leq günq. <verse eid="MRK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10" />Gapaq kahgan manneq kogenq lhasaq rammeq kum jangxleq tha paox phaleq Jesu to yop je khumqleq günq.<verse eid="MRK 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11" />Gaq jenmaq gükjongx kahsungq khaa maq shah kohleq tei. <verse eid="MRK 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12" />Lhasaq rammeq Jesu to günq, “Komx gük lheiqka paoxpha, geithungteq komx kumgeka paowao.” <verse eid="MRK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13" />Kuweq kum paoxwa koh, kogenq lhasaqram khüonyak manne ngaix geithungteq gük jong maq nyep. Gük hingqanyix gonxle tipaq gükjongx rapleq ngaqnga khongqleq geithungteq gükkhüo yu phatleq rap jie maq singleq rix.<verse eid="MRK 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14" />Gük teipaq khüonyak ram phatleq paox, geithungteq thaogongxram ji Chingq mao khüonyak ram geithungteq chingqnyuq mao ram to gaankhongx. Chemngeihleq gato tux a khüonyak ram heih. <verse eid="MRK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15" />Kum Jesu geto pei geithungteq kogenq lhasaq meilangle tipaq khüonyak nganx; khuq gunxle le khüonyak komei unneq jong le ngant, geithuphe kum rapleq gax. <verse eid="MRK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16" />Aopangngeq koyingxmaq ngantnu; kummeq, kogenq lhasaq ji khüonyak geithungteq gük jux khüonyakram to günq.<verse eid="MRK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17" />Geithuphe kum kahgan manneq yoyox maq paotah leq Jesu to kummeq günq.<verse eid="MRK 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18" />Geithuphe Jesu lekhung to zongq, kogenq lhasaq tipaq khüonyak jaq kotoq kih, “ka naq phe goixkhah!”<verse eid="MRK 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19" />Geithibao Jesu weq ku hagoix; geithungteq agaunneq, “Nümx kaixkaoq geka leihtah geithungteq Taihungpaq ginlhakkax aogonx monmok geithungteq aogonxleq banx gaga goix to günnan!” leq günq.<verse eid="MRK 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20" />Gapheimaq gapaq khüonyak leih geithungteq Decapolis gaankamx maq tepaq chingqnyuq banx to Jesu weq ko ginlhakkax champopogi ringq kuweq günleq pongx, aopangngeq gapaq ngaox tanx kum rap khampungxlob.<verse eid="MRK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jairus Kosaqnyaq ji Jesu Khuqjunq to Makpaq Mihnyu Nya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Matthew 9.18–26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luke 8.40–56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21" />Geithuphi Jesu jam jalheiq jie kaoka lekhung manneq leih; beenyusaq ko jenmaq heih; geithuphe ku jie nahma tei, <verse eid="MRK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22" />Gama Jairus le münxpaq beeheihkamp eikhungpaq jaq pei, geithungteq kuweq Jesu to günq, Ku ko lhajongmaq lhaqkuh shongqleq bam; <verse eid="MRK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23" />Geithungteq kuweq meilangleq kopong teihleq yuleq, “Kar saq naoki nya rixya shohleq kakleq tetao yoyomaq peikei geithungteq ko khüomaq naq lhak zanx pha, gama ku meiyao geithungteq komaq agang tiyaox!” leq günq.<verse eid="MRK 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24" />Geithuyaoxwe Jesu ko phi lhaqyongq. Beenyusaq kopheito goix geithungteq pangyungxthangmaq khüonyakkeq münx.<verse eid="MRK 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25" />Geithuphi mihnyu nya jaq ganglaoq banxbaayix ngoiyeleq harakkeq agie yinpaq nya jaq tei, <verse eid="MRK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26" />gaga nya kaktuxpaqram meilangpheq pongx babe geithungteq komaq tipaq ngunq rap bakkeq leq kakjex shah babix hamei, meikha thuleixmaq segent leq paq teix. <verse eid="MRK 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27" />Jesu jux gaga nya e tanx, geithuphi beenyusaq tokphei manneq gaga nya pei, <verse eid="MRK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28" />geithungteq kuweq ko lhongx lhongx ka gaga nya e aleq, “Koiyeq ku khuqjungq to shiqmak banox ka kak mei yaox” leq günq.<verse eid="MRK 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29" />Gaga nya e ko khuqjungq to tamx peileix ye ganyamaq yinleq tipaq agieq rak; geithuphe gaga nya e ku thangxngo manneq meitatoleq tingxleq pei. <verse eid="MRK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30" />Gajux maq oh leq kumaoq gongx paoxpaq Jesu weq tingx, geithuphi beenyusaq lheiqka lableq lheileq kuweq, “Kar khuqjunq to aoweq makkuq?” leq günq.<verse eid="MRK 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31" />Ku Samsaram meq aga unxneq, “Naq jenmaq khüonyak gapong heihleq tiu; natoq aoweq makkuqleq beiq kih u?” leq lox.<verse eid="MRK 5:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32" />Geithibao aoweq makkuq ngeihle tingngathuq leimaq Jesu weq ngeihle tux. <verse eid="MRK 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33" />Kutoq chemngaile mihnyu nya e tingxleq pei geithuphe ga u we gaga nya yakjinyonle pei geithungteq ku lhajongmaq lhaqkuh shungxleq bam, geithungteq koyingx maq tepaq kutoq rapleq günq. <verse eid="MRK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34" />Jesu weq gax nya to, “Kar saqnyaq, nangqngeq koyingteih u we naq mei taga. Chingqmeixmaq leihtah, geithungteq naq thangxnguq manne meixunx” leq lox.<verse eid="MRK 5:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35" />Mojux maq Jesu gingleq tei Jairus Kamp mao monxtanxpaq pei geithungteq kotoq, “Nasaq rixtaga chemleimaq honxnüoqpaq to thangxngax kohleq jongngu?” leq günq.<verse eid="MRK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36" />Geithibao kummeq kotoq günqpaq ngaoxtoq Jesu weq mong hakoh,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.36 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Jesu weq mong hakoh; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">geihalhangba </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">hanxmeileq hatanpaq.</char></note> geithungteq kotoq, “Thagax koyingx gale teihunx” leq günq. <verse eid="MRK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37" />Gapheimaq Jesu weq Peter, James geithungteq konao John ram tok to aobix kophi hagoix. <verse eid="MRK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38" />Mojux maq kum meq eikhungpaq Kamp peiyungeihle khüonyakram hapging nyarkgingx phe meilangle Jesu weq ngant. <verse eid="MRK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39" />Ku Kamp kha yu nyap geithungteq kum to, “Chamleimaq gagonxleq nümx mobpuq? Gaga naonyaq nox rix yu mantlhangq, kuno nguh u ngeih!” leq günq.<verse eid="MRK 5:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40" />Kum rap ku to yai, geithuphe ku e kum rap changx leq paox geithungteq naonyaq konyuq kopaq nyix ku Samqsaqram lah le nao mang toi le tipaq nyoiq to nyep. <verse eid="MRK 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41" />Ko lhak maq ku e naonyaq pai geithungteq aleq, “Talitha, koum” leppomaq, “Naosaq nya! Koi e natoq günqnungeih, rüoqwen!” leq günq.<verse eid="MRK 5:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42" />Gaga Naosaq nya peileix e rüoq geithungteq ngeihle kaamleq. Naonyaq chux banxbaanyix yalhang. Mojuxmaq gax ngant kum rappoq khampungxlob! <verse eid="MRK 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43" />Geithibao aga jux aotobix hagünnathu leimaq Jesu weq ngaoxhung koh, geithungteq kuweq, “Nao nya to shah je ying jagee jaq kohunx” leq günq.<verse eid="MRK 5:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6" />
  <para style="s">Nazareth maq Jesu Halahpaq</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Matthew 13.53–58</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luke 4.16–30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1" />Jesu weq gapaq nyoiq tah oungte kum nyupuh chingqnyuq ka leih, geithuphix ko samqsaqram bex ko phi goix. <verse eid="MRK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2" />Sabbath nyih beeheihkamp maq ku weq honxnüoq a ya, gama khüonyakram meilangle tei; geithuphi mojuxmaq kummeq ko ngaox tanx kum rapleq khampungxlop, kummeq aga unxne kih, “agaphangx rappoq ku weq ayungx mao takkungeih? ku weq beiq unxne agaphangx honxjemanx takkungeih? geithungteq ku weq gaga kahhonxangmanx monx beiqyenneq ringq zokkungeih? <verse eid="MRK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3" />Aga nox Mary kosaq lhak monmok paq geithungteq James, Joseph, Judas ji Simon ko jeiq mantlhangjea? Agamaq ko naonya ramq bix tiü halhangngujea?” Geithuphi kummeq ku halah.<verse eid="MRK 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6.4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 4:44">Jhn 4.44</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Gajux maq Jesu weq kumtoq, “Ashipaq jaq ko nyupuh chingqthaoq, geithungteq kophux, geithungteq mamax kaixkaoq kampkha tokto kai leq pangqyungx maq ha oh e mant tei” leq günq.<verse eid="MRK 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5" />Galeima kakpaq kokao lhak keq tamxleq mei a koh u phi nyeiqleq, ku weq kahhonxangmanx monx jajage mokka hazok. <verse eid="MRK 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6" />Kummeq koyingxleq teihpaq ha tiu to ku meilangle khampungxlop.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="MRK 6:6">Jesu weq Samqsaqram Banxbaqanyix Pongleq Paox</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 6:6">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Matthew 10.5–15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luke 9.1–6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:6">Gapheimaq Jesu weq khüonyak ram to honxnüoqleq Nok ji nok to kamq. <verse eid="MRK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7" />Gapheimaq ku weq Samqsaqram banxbaq anyi goih e nyark, geithungteq anyi anyixle pongleq paox. Kogenq lhasaq gahmaq komx to ku weq gongx koh; <verse eid="MRK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.8–11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:4-11">Luk 10.4–11</ref></char></note>Geithungteq komx to ngaoxhong koh, “Kamq juxma keathuh phi nümx meq jajage thalah, unx thalah khufeaq thalah, ngunqshuq geet khufeaq maq ngunq mant lahaox. <verse eid="MRK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9" />Lhaqlop loppanx geithebabeq lhaklop konyei thalah,” <verse eid="MRK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10" />Ku weq kum to günq, “Mojuxmaq nümx chingq jaq to ngoiyao ngeihle aopangngeq nümx lah oh ngeih leq nümx mopao mopaoleq garam kamq maq jongnganx. <verse eid="MRK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:51">Lümp 13.51</ref></char></note>Geithungteq nok kokao weq nümx ngaox halah geithungteq nümx ngaox to hapoparam nok maq pei ji ngoi banox mojux maq nümx paoxwaox ngeihle nümx lhaq mao laxtap kongleq tahunx, gaga kum ginlhakkax tamxrünnax lhangngaox.”<verse eid="MRK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12" />Gapheimaq kum paox, geithungteq khüonyak ram rapleq konyux manneq monglap pünxleq honxnüoq. <verse eid="MRK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 5:14">Jam 5.14</ref></char></note>Kum meq lhahboq ram changx leq paox, geithungteq kakpaq ramto nganxjie phi poleq kum kak mei.<verse eid="MRK 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Baptixpaq John Rixpaq</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Matthew 14.1–12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luke 9.7–9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6.14,15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 16:14">Mat 16.14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:28">Mrk 8.28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:19">Luk 9.19</ref></char>
    </note>Aleq Herod angampaq<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.14 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Herod angampaq: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Herod Antipas, Galilee Angpün.</char></note> e gapaq jux tanx, chemleimathibaq Jesu münx pangqyungx maq ngaix. Khüonyak rammeq, “Baptixpa John gangleq leih tatao! geithuphi gapaq Kahhonxangmanx gongx nge ku weq monx mokku lhangga,” leq günq.<verse eid="MRK 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15" />Amungq rammeq aga unx neq, “Ku nox Elijah lhangga.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:15">Chambix amungq rammeq günq, “Ku nox thaoka tipaq mao asi ko boh jaq lhangga” leq günq.<verse eid="MRK 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16" />Geithibaoq mojux maq Herod angampa eq gaga tanx, kuweq günq, “ku nox Baptixpa John koi yeq ko khüo tat phei, geithebaoq gangleq leih phei lhangga!” <verse eid="MRK 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.17,18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 3:19">Luk 3.19</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 3:20">20</ref></char></note>John laoqwathuq ginlhakkax Herod teq ngaoxhung koh, geithungteq lao je khax leq tenxkamp maq thamq. Chemleimathebaq Herodias nox konao philip koshanyuq a lhangleq tei, galeima Herod teq gaga ringq. <verse eid="MRK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18" />Chamleixma thiba Baptixpa Johnneq herod to günq, “naq nao ko sanyuq nangq nge lah a mant zok.”<verse eid="MRK 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19" />Geithuwe ye Herodia e John to nyux, geithungteq ku langx nga tue, geithebaoq herod tiu yaox we ku weq langxngax hazok. <verse eid="MRK 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20" />John to Herod gax, chemleimathibaq John shaokhak ko khüonyak geithungteq koyaoq khüonyak. Geithuyaoxwe ku weq gangleq thamq. Kojux tanxnu jux maq ku weq kotoq hamei ye pok babi ku weq ko ngaox komei yaq shingxleq tanx.<verse eid="MRK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21" />Koka a Herodia e ginlhak komei jaq tak. Gaga nox Herod puhpaq nyih, kophang mao eikhung ramphe naomei eikhung ramphi, geithungteq Galilee eikhung ram nyarkleq aorayx koboh Juh u jaq lhang. <verse eid="MRK 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22" />Herodia kosaq mihnyusaq<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.22 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Herodia kosaq mihnyusaq; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kokao lhakgoxlaiq </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ku saqnyaq Herodias, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">le titao.</char></note> shonleq tei gük, geithuphe Herod ji ko günparam mong meixya koh. Geithuphe angampa e mihnyu naosaq to günq, nangq nge chemphang lah a tuetao? “Nangq nge chem to lung koi yeq phawaox.” <verse eid="MRK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23" />Geithuphix ku weq naonyaq to ronxleq günq, nangq nge chem to lungleq yukei. “Ka angchingq anye ya tanxnu pongleq yu ba yaoxbe phawaox.”<verse eid="MRK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24" />Geithuphe naonyaq phatleq yuqle ko nyu to kih, “koi yeq Chem yukhah?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:24">Ko nyu weq lox, “Baptixpa John khüotamq yuwenx.”<verse eid="MRK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25" />Angampaq geyuh naonyaq nanneq phatleq leih, geithungteq aga unxne yu. “Baptixpa John khüo khungja maq zanxle aleleq phakeileq naq to yu ungeih!”<verse eid="MRK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26" />Angngampaq meilang mongthang; geithebaoq kogimaq peipa günparam rappoq muhthaoq maq ku weq kahjoq phei a lhangleq Ku weq naonyaq to mantleq günqna ha tux. <verse eid="MRK 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27" />Geithuyaoxwe Herod teq John khüotamq peiyathuq ginlhakkax gaantux param tenxkampka rale John khüotamq tat; <verse eid="MRK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28" />Gapheimaq kuweq John khüo khungja maq lahleq pei geithungteq naonyaq to koh, gaga ko nyu to koh, <verse eid="MRK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29" />Mojuxmaq John Samqsaqrammeq gaga ngaox tanx, kum pei geithungteq ko mang lah, geithungteq günx jaq maq gue-u.<verse eid="MRK 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu weq Hingq Anyax Juh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Matthew 14.13–21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luke 9.10–17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">John 6.1–14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30" />Lümparam nongxleq leih geithungteq Jesu phi pong, geithungteq kum meq nüopa je ringqngoq rappoq Jesu to günq. <verse eid="MRK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31" />Khüonyakram meilang peipa ji paoxpaq tei, gaga a lhangleq Jesu ko Samsaram phe tamx shah a ginlhak hatak. Geithuphe ku weq kum to günq, “Sisa ginlhakkax noxrakmei a thuq lung lamqleq kim su paoxkhah.” <verse eid="MRK 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32" />Geithuphi lekhung jaqmaq zongqngungqte gaanzangx lümma kum lhaqyoungq.<verse eid="MRK 6:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33" />Khüonyakram me kum paoxpaq ngant, geithungteq kum aopangq paox peileix tingx, geithuphi kum rap chingqthaoq tahoungteq lhaq manne phat, geithuphi Jesu ji ko Samqsaqram mopei ye galung maq kum thaogunnax pei. <verse eid="MRK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:36">Mat 9.36</ref></char></note>Mojux maq lekhung mao Jesu weq yu, ku weq khüonyak ram meilang ngant, geithuphe kum ginlhakkax ko mong maq ku yoyoleq teih, chemleimathibaq nir teipaq hatipaq nirram manneq kum ngant. Geithuphe ku weq pangqge kum to nüowa gang. <verse eid="MRK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35" />Mojux maq, “ginlhak pheileq pei ko Samqsaqram ko geto pei geithungteq aleq günq, Ataq nox ginlhak meilang pheitataoq geithungteq aganox gaanzangx. <verse eid="MRK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36" />Khüonyakram yanna kuhkoh, geithungteq kümxpaqnampaq mao chingqnyuq geithungteq thaoqgongxpaq ram gemaoq kummeq shah a nashah lah.”<verse eid="MRK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37" />Jesu weq lox, “nümxmeq kummaq shah a thuq jageja kohunx.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:37">Kummeq kih, “komx paoxleq tunq ngunq<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.37 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">tunq ngunq: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tunq ngunq khüoja nox nyihja-ü thaoqgongq ginlhak shak (tuxwen </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 20:2">Mat 20.2</ref></char>).</note> gokbanx anye phi unx shakleq kum to juh a tux u jea?”<verse eid="MRK 6:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38" />Jesu weq kumtoq, “Nümx maq an aogonx titao? leih leq tuxwen.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:38">Mojuxmaq kummeq takkungeih kummeq kotoq günq, “ünkhüox anyax geithungteq nyahyangq anyi” leq kih.<verse eid="MRK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39" />Gajuxmaq khüonyakram rap thamq khüoka kozon kozon jongngax kohunxleq Jesu weq ko Samqsaqram to ngaox koh. <verse eid="MRK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40" />Gapheimaq khüonyak ram kozon kozon gokbanx zonqq geithungteq gokanya zonqq le jong. <verse eid="MRK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41" />Gapheimaq Jesu weq ünkhüox anyax nyahyangq anyix tamxleq, angtoq tux geithungteq Younggan to münxboh koh. Ku weq unx khih geithungteq khüonyakram to tanxnanx le ku weq ko Samqsaqram maq koh. Ku e nyahyangq anye yubix kum rappoq to tantleq koh. <verse eid="MRK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42" />Kum rappoiq ye shah geithungteq gomq phonx. <verse eid="MRK 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43" />Gapheimaq Samqsaqram me unx ji nyah jaxpaq kaqmb banxbaanyix haile heih. <verse eid="MRK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44" />Geithungteq unx ji nyah shahpaq mihparam hingqanya ngoi yeleq tei.<verse eid="MRK 6:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Jie khüo maq Kamq</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Matthew 14.22–33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">John 6.15–21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45" />Gajuxmaq oh le ku weq khüonyak ram yanleq paox pheimaq ko Samqsaqram lekhung jaq to zongqngax koh, geithungteq kum muhthaoq mao jalheiq jie kaox Bethsaida chingqnyuq kax paox. <verse eid="MRK 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46" />Khüonyak ram to yanx ngaox günle paox pheimaq kahtoq jaq to angphung nga ku zongq. <verse eid="MRK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47" />Mojuxmaq günq ngoi lekhung geenyuq tanxmaq tei, geithungteq Jesu ko jaaleq kaganmaq tei. <verse eid="MRK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48" />Chemleimathibaq lheixkeiq khaka jie khüoka kum leq u phi lekhung hex jie loak kuleixmaq ko Samsaram thangxpaq kuweq ngant, geithuphi nüpnyingq üokanx pongxmaq jie khüomaq kaamleq ku pei. Kum lenxleq paox,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.48 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kum lenxleq paox; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">galehalhangba </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">kum phi nang.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49" />Geithibao mojuxmaq kummeq ku jie khüoka kaamleq ngant, “aganox lhahboq jaq!” lhanggale kummeq teih, geithungteq kum chingqgarkle hap. <verse eid="MRK 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50" />Chamleima thibaq mojuxmaq kum rappoiq ye ku ngant kum gax.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:50">Gajuxmaq oh le Jesu weq kum to, “Mongbohunx!” “aganox kangeih, thagax!” leq günq. <verse eid="MRK 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51" />Gapheimaq kumphe goih e ku lekhungtoq zongq, geithuphe lheix rak. Samqsaqram meilangle khampungxlopleq kopong yaox hatak. <verse eid="MRK 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52" />Kummeq hingqanya to Juhpaq to lebpu jemphangx ngeihle hatingx, kum mong künttingle haleih.<verse eid="MRK 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gennesaret maq Kakpaqram Meiqleq Koh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:34-36">Matthew 14.34–36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53" />Geithuphe mojuxmaq kummeq sungx toole Gennesaret chingqnyuq ngoi, kummeq lekhung gama toole tah. <verse eid="MRK 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54" />Kummeq lekhung tah-u phe goih e khüonyak rammeq Jesu tingx. <verse eid="MRK 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55" />Geithuphe gapaq kahgan maq tipaq khüonyak rammeq kakpaqram kummeq züm maq paile pei, ayung maq ku tiungeihleq tanx, ko geto pei. <verse eid="MRK 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56" />Geithuphe ayung maq ku chingqthaoq maq beeheihpaq maq geihalhangba gaankamx pei u ngeihle kakpaqram paile peile thoqshakgüohünq lung maq yaoxbe peile ko khuqjunq to yaoxbe makka pha keileq shomxjitoleq günq. Aopangngeq letleq rap meiqleq koh.<verse eid="MRK 6:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7" />
  <para style="s">Nyakmei Rammeq Nüopaq Banlam Korangq</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:1-9">Matthew 15.1–9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1" />Mojuxmaq Pharase ram geithungteq ngaoxhung nüoparam aopangq Jerusalem mao pei Jesu to ngeihleq heih. <verse eid="MRK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2" />Ko Samsaram kokao weq hatuh paq lhak phi tamq shahpaq tuxleq kap gaga nox pharase ram ji amungram banlam phe mant shao.<verse eid="MRK 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3" />(Chamleixma thiba pharase ram ji Jehudirammeq rapleq kum puram meq nüopaq lah; geithuyaoxweq kummeq lhak hatuh e tamq shah ü banlam hateix, <verse eid="MRK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4" />Geihalhangba thoqshaklungq manneq leihpaq agangnga hatuh e jajage mant shah<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.4 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">thoqshaklungq manneq leihpaq agangnga hatuh e jajage mant shah; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">galehalhangba </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">jajage thoqshaklungq manneq leihpaq agangnga hatuh eq mant shah.</char></note> geihalhangba chempopogi thoqshaklungq manneq shak leih u ngeihleq agangnga kummeq ga hatuh e mant shah. Geithungteq khung ji ruh, jick, khapsanq soiqkhung, geithungteq lay jongx<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kokao lhakgoxpalaiq maq </char><char style="fq" closed="false">lay jongx </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mant teix </char></note> jampopoge ganglüm maq yaoq wathuq kahhung meilangle teix.)<verse eid="MRK 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5" />Geithuweyeq Pharase ji ngaoxhung nüoparammeq Jesu to, “Komx puq ram kamanneq lahleq peipaq banlam chamleixma naq Samqsaqrammeq hagoix ü? Gatok to hatuhpaq lhak phix shah ü jea?” leq kih.<verse eid="MRK 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6" />Gajuxmaq Jesu weq kumtoq lox, “Isaiah Ashipaq e nümx ginlhakkax günqleq thampaq chammünxneq shaotaoq! Nümx chuntok gax meipaqram kuweq agaunxneq gox:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">“ ‘Aga khüonyak rammeq chun maq galeq kar oxjishox,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:6">Geithibao kum mongkha nox kar phi meilang kooleq.<verse eid="MRK 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7" />Kummeq kar to yopjishom panox bangqba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:7">Chamleima thiba Younggan ngaoxhung tipheimaq</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 7:7">Khüonyak keq ringqpaq ngaoxhung kummeq nüo!’ ” leq günq.<verse eid="MRK 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8" />Geithungteq Jesu weq, “Nümxmeq Younggan ngaoxhung phapaq hatammeq tahoungteq khüonyakkeq nüopaq puq banglam to mongkoh” leq günq.<verse eid="MRK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9" />Geithungteq Jesu weq, “Meilangleq teiqjitaleq nümxmeq Younggan ngaoxhung tahoungteq nümxmeq nüopaq puq ganglam tamxmu, <verse eid="MRK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10" />Chamleima thiba Mosa e aleq nüo, ‘Naq nyuq Naq paq to oxjishox lah’ geithungteq ‘aoweq ko paq galehalhangba ko nyuq to ngaox hopjinyan günqnu leq ku rixya koh ao.’ <verse eid="MRK 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11" />Geithibao nümxmeq aga unxneq nüo kokao e ko nyuq ji ko paq to tüoh a zok leq teix, ‘aganox Corban’ (lebpu, nox Younggan ginlhak), <verse eid="MRK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12" />Kotoq atanox ko nyuq ji ko paq ginlhakkax jajage ringqngax mant koh: <verse eid="MRK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13" />Gaq unxneq nümx meq nüopa khüonyak ram to kohleq Younggan ngaox to oxjishox hateix weyeq gaga unxneq nümxmeq ringqpaq amungq monxthaoq meilangleq titao” leq harakkeq günq.<verse eid="MRK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Khüonyak ja to Khunxjinyunxnaq Koh Paq</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:10-20">Matthew 15.10–20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14" />Jam Jesu weq ko jenmaq beenyusaq nyark geithungteq kum to, nümx rappoiq ye, “ka ngaox tanxnanx, geithungteq tingxnganx. <verse eid="MRK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15" />Khüonyak jaq nyux leq koh athuq leimaq kotok kamanneq peipaq jajage mantteix. Galeileinox khüonyak jaq manneq ngaipa e ku nyux leq koh ungeih” leq günq. <verse eid="MRK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" pubnumber="[16]" sid="MRK 7:16" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kokao lhakgoxlaiq maq lhaakpaq banxbaagok maq </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Tanxna thuq naxkhoh tibanox ku weq tanxnanx, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">leq baoleq gox leq titao (</char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 4:23">4.23</ref></char> maq tuxwen).</note><verse eid="MRK 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17" />Mojuxmaq beenyusaq tahoungteq ku paoleq Kamp kha jaq to nyep, Samqsaqram meq gaga ngaox lebpu jux kotoq kih. <verse eid="MRK 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18" />Geithuphi Jesu weq kumtoq, “Geithibanox nümxmeq bix tingxngax zokku mantlhangnye? Nümxmeq gaga hatingxngujea? kotok kamanneq jampoqpogeq khüonyak jaqmaq nyep paox ngeihleq gage yeq nyux a mantzok: <verse eid="MRK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19" />Chamleima thibaq gaga nox ko mong kha to mant nyep, geithibao shinqnyuq kha maq nyepleq kotokka lejark leq paoleq ham mungeih” leq günq. (Jesu weq aga günqnux leixmaq, shah ji ying rapleq koyaoqleq hoxtaoq.)<verse eid="MRK 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20" />Geithungteq ku weq, “Khüonyak ko manneq Cham ngai gage yeq khüonyak jaq nyux a koh ü ngeih. <verse eid="MRK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21" />Chamleima thibaq khüonyak mong kha ko mong mao konyux mongteih geithungteq konyux monxringq ngathuq kuh athuq, langx ngathuq, <verse eid="MRK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22" />Sophungngathuq, konyei lah a tue paq geithungteq konyux monxthaoq rappoq ringqpaq, nyemgent, ngomxpaq, aosingpaq, sheiqpaq, phohjihaipaq, goqjingampaq, taixjibaixpaq, <verse eid="MRK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23" />gaga rappuq konyux khüonyak jaq ko mong manneq ngai u ngeih gage yeq konyux leq koh ü ngeih,” harakkeq günq.<verse eid="MRK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Koyingteih ü Mihnyu Jaq</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:21-28">Matthew 15.21–28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24" />Geithungteq gapheimaq gaga lung manxneq Jesu lhaqyongqleq Tyre lheiqka paoleq ku Kamp kha jatoq nyep. Geithungteq ku gamaq tiü leq aotoq bix tingxngax koh a ha tue, geithibao ku ronxleq jongngax hazok. <verse eid="MRK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25" />Geithibao konyuq nya jaq kosaq nya jaqmaq konyux lhasaq teix, gax nya e Jesu jux tanx geithuphi nanneq Jesu geto peileq ko lhaq jongmaq bamleq günq. <verse eid="MRK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26" />Gaga mihnyu nya nox Phoenicia mao Syrian maq puhpaq Greek nya jaq a lhang. Ku weq Jesu to ku saqnyaq mao lhahbo changx kei leq günq. <verse eid="MRK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27" />Geithibaoq Jesu weq gaga nyaq to, “Agangxngax Naosaq ram to phonx ne leq sekohkhah. Chamleima thibaq Naosaqramq mao tamq lahleq kie saqram maq koh a mantmei,” leq günq.<verse eid="MRK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28" />Mihnyu nya e, “Taihungpaq, kie saqrammeq bix tabkhung phang maq nyepleq Naosaq rammeq yaxpaq koja shah tongeih!” leq lox.<verse eid="MRK 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29" />Geithibabix Jesu weq, “Nangqngeq gaga unxneq günqnu leimaq, Naq leih ü zok kaox; Naosaq nya mao lhahboq paotaga!” leq günq.<verse eid="MRK 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30" />Geithuphi gaga nya kamp ka leih geithungteq ko saqnya mao lhahbo paoleq naolhasaq laymaq gayxleq tipaq ngant.<verse eid="MRK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu weq Naxbo ji Ngaoxakpa Meiqleq koh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31" />Gapheimaq Tyre jenmaq tiparam tahoungteq Jesu leihleq Sidon lümmaq, Galilee gotnyuq kaileq Decapolis<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.31 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Decapolis; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nox gankam, gamaq chingnyuq banx leq ti-ü.</char></note> gankam güi leq leih. <verse eid="MRK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32" />Khüonyak kokao weq nabo geithungteq ngaox bix gingngax hazokpaq jaq koge to lahleq pei, geithuphi kotoq lhakke tamxphaleq Jesu to kih. <verse eid="MRK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33" />Jesu weq ku jaaleq beenyusaq tanx manneq goixleq paox, ko lhakkhe to Juhonx phi thonx nungteq naxkhoh to mak, geithungteq ko lee to tamx. <verse eid="MRK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34" />Gapheimaq Jesu weq angkhüo to tux, geithungteq rünx phi lhongq, geithungteq khüonyak to, <char style="tl">“Ephphatha!”</char> leq günq, lebpu, “Zappün!”<verse eid="MRK 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35" />Peileiyeq ko naxkhoh zap, ku lee lappaq zok geithungteq hathang nge ging. <verse eid="MRK 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36" />Gapheimaq Jesu weq ao to bix hagünq nathuq ginlhak kaxleq kum rap to ngaox koh; geithibabix kuweq ao gonxleq hagünnathu thatmaq tenx gabejileq khüonyak rammeq gaga jux günq. <verse eid="MRK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37" />Geithuphi aopangngeq gax ngaox tanx, “Kuweq rap meiqleq ringqngax zok; kuweq nabo paq tanxna koh geithungteq ngaox ekjiakpaq ngaox ngaix a koh” leq kum rappoiq ye meilangleq khampungxlop.<verse eid="MRK 7:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8" />
  <para style="s">Jesu weq Hingq Begix to Juh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 15:32-39">Matthew 15.32–39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1" />Gajuxmaq oh le Chambix amungq beenyusaq heih geithuphix kum maq shah athuq jajage hateix. Jesu weq ko Samqsaqram kogitoq nyark kung teq; <verse eid="MRK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2" />“Aga khüonyakram ginlhakkax kaq yoyotao, chamleixmaqthibaq kum kaq phi nyih aram ngoi ye leq jongngungqtaoq, geithibao aleq shah athuq jajage mantteix. <verse eid="MRK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3" />Koi yeq kum to hajuh e paoxbanox kum kamq juxmaq nonxnga leq toiyaox, chamleixmaqthibaq kum kokao lümlaoq manneq peiyuq” leq günq.<verse eid="MRK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4" />Ko Samqsaqrammeq, “Aga phihphoyo maq aoweq agonxnyuq khüonyakram ginxlhakka phonx ne leq aomaoq an tak zokka?” leq lox.<verse eid="MRK 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5" />Gajuxmaq Jesuweq kum to kih, “nümx maq an aogonx titao?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:5">Kummeq lox, “ankhaox ananth” titao.<verse eid="MRK 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6" />Kuweq beenyusaq to kahyo maq jongngantxleq günq. Gapheimaq kuweq ünkhüox ananth to lah, Younggan to münxboh koh, Gaga pakjitak, geithungteq beenyusaq to tantna kuweq Samqsaqram to koh; geithuphi kummeq galeq ringq. <verse eid="MRK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7" />Kum maq Chambix nyah sisateix. Gaq ginlhakkax bix Jesuweq münxboh koh geithungteq Samqsaqram to gagabix tantnathuq ginlhakkax günq. <verse eid="MRK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8" />Geithuphi kum khüonyakram rappeq shahleq kum gomq phonx, geithungteq kummeq chaxpaq kokhih haiq tuxbaq kamb ananth münxneqleq bangx. <verse eid="MRK 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9" />Geithuphi khüonyakram hingq begix gonxleq teix, gamanq pheimaq kuweq kum paoxwa koh. <verse eid="MRK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10" />Geithungteq peileix yeq ko Samsaram phi lekhung to zongq geithungteq Dalmanutha gaankamx to paox.<verse eid="MRK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pharase Rammeq Kahhonxangmanx Jux Kih</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:1-4">Matthew 16.1–4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8.11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 12:38">Mat 12.38</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:16">Luk 11.16</ref> </char>
    </note>Pharase ram kokao pei geithungteq Jesu phi gingngax yax. Kummeq kotoq tonlamq maq tue, geithuphix angkhüo maoq kahhonxangmanx jaq ringqkeileq kummeq kotoq günq. <verse eid="MRK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:39">Mat 12.39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:29">Luk 11.29</ref> </char></note>Geithibabix Jesu rueleq mongpüok: “Chamleixmaq agax yinx maoqram meq kahhonxangmanx kih ü? Koyingxmaq koi yeq nümx to günnyuxngeih. Agapaq yinjijenmaq kahhonxangmanx jajage mant hox waox!” ku weq günq.<verse eid="MRK 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13" />Gapheimaq ku weq kum tahoungteq lekhung to zongq, geithungteq jalheiq gotnyu kaoka tox a gang.<verse eid="MRK 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pharase Ram Phushum ji Herod</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:5-12">Matthew 16.5–12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14" />Samqsaqrammeq an lah athu lakleq tah, geithungteq kum lekhung maq zongqnguq juxmaq ankhüox jaagax jaq teix. <verse eid="MRK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15" />Geithuphix <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:1">Luk 12.1</ref> </char></note>Jesu weq kum to, “Künting ngathuq ngaox, tux leq günqnan geithungteq pharase ram mao phushum ji Herod angam mao phushum ginxlhakka nümx” leq ku weq günq.<verse eid="MRK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16" />Kum bamaq agaunxneq jaqjaq phi gingleq, “Kim maq jajage an hatikoiyeq ku weq aga ngaox günqnu” leq günq.<verse eid="MRK 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17" />Kummeq cham ngaox günleq Jesu weq tingx, geithuphi, “An hatipaq jux nümxmeq chamleixmaq gingnguq? Nümxmeq kopong yaox hatak geihalhangba mant ngantjea? Nümx mong gojikeaganye? <verse eid="MRK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 4:12">Mrk 4.12</ref> </char></note>Nümx maq mik ti ü nümx meq hangantnu jea? Nümx maq nax ti ü nümx meq hatanxnu jea? Nümx meq teihlehatak ku jea? <verse eid="MRK 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19" />Mojuxmaq koiyeq hingq anyax ü ginlhakkax ankhaox anyax woq ga pakleq khih? kojaxkonax nümx meq kamb aogonx heihtaoq?” kuweq kum to kih.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:19">Kum me lox, “Kamb Banxbaanyix,” leq.<verse eid="MRK 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20" />Geithungteq, Jesu weq “Mojuxmaq koiyeq an ananth to khüonyak hingq begix ginxlhakka khih, jaxpaq kokhih kamb aobiq nümx meq tonq tao?” leq kih.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:20">Kum meq kotoq lox, kamb “ananth.”<verse eid="MRK 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21" />Geithuphi Ku weq kum to, “Nümx meq aleq to ngoiyeleq manttingx zoknye?” leq günq.<verse eid="MRK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bethsaida maq Mikzüwkpaq Jaq Jesu weq Meileq Koh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22" />Geithuphi Kum Bethsaida to pei mikzüwkpaq khüonyak jaq Jesu geto goixleq pei, geithungteq khüonyak ram meq kotoq tamxphaleq shomxjito. <verse eid="MRK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23" />Jesu weq mikzüwkpaq lhakmaq tamx geithungteq khungx manneq goixlepao. Geithungteq mojuxmaq kuweq khüonyak mik to chuhon phi thonx Jesu lhak keq kotoq tamx geithungteq, “Nangqngeq jajage ngantya?” leq kih.<verse eid="MRK 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24" />Khüonyakpa eq ngoq leq tux geithungteq, “Koiyeq khüonyakram nganttao, geithibao kum pün yaoyao leq kamqmuq nganttao” leq ku weq günq.<verse eid="MRK 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25" />Jesu weq Chambix khüonyak mik to tamx, aleq gapaq khüonyakkeq tinglingqleq tux, ko mik keq ngantzok geithungteq kuweq pangqge hünmeileq ngant. <verse eid="MRK 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26" />Gaphaimaq Jesu weq ku Kamp ka leih a koh, “Geithibao nokmaq thanyap” ngaoxhung koh.<verse eid="MRK 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Peter yeq Jesu nox Messiah Ngeihleq Loxpaq</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-20">Matthew 16.13–20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luke 9.18–21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27" />Gapheimaq Jesu geithungteq ko Samqsaqram Caesarea Philippi jen mao chingq jaq to paox. Lüm ba maq ku weq Samqsaqram to, “ka to günkei khüonyak ram meq ka aoleq günqtaoq?” leq kih.<verse eid="MRK 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8.28 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 6:14">Mrk 6.14</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 6:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7">Luk 9.7</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 9:8">8</ref> </char>
    </note> Kum meq, “Kokao weq nox Baptixpa Johnleq günq tao” “kokao weq naq nox ashipaqram beemaoq jaqleq günq juxmaq, kokao weq naq nox Elijah; lhanggaleq günqtaoq” leq lox.<verse eid="MRK 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8.29 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 6:68">Jhn 6.68</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 6:69">69</ref></char>
    </note> “Geithibanox nümx meq beiqyenxneq Kaq aoleq günqtaoq?” leq ku weq kih.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 8:29">“Naq nox Messiah” leq Peter yeq lox.<verse eid="MRK 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30" />Gapheimaq Jesu weq, “agajux aotobix thagünyoleq,” kum to ngaox kohleq günq.<verse eid="MRK 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu weq Ku Thangxngathuq ji Rixyathuq jux Günq</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:21-28">Matthew 16.21–28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Luke 9.22–27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31" />Gaphaimaq Jesu weq ko Samqsaqram to, “khüonyak kosaq meilangleq thangxngaox, geithungteq nyakmei ram, eikhung gamxpaq ram geithungteq ngaoxhung nüoparam meq mant lah ao, ku langxngaox, geithungteq nyih aram günt aram phaimaq jamq gangleq leihaoq,” leq nüowa kokigang. <verse eid="MRK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32" />Ku weq kum to ngaix leq günq. Geithuphi Peter yeq ku goix leq paoxoungte shih ayaq. <verse eid="MRK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33" />Geithuphi Jesu nongleq leih, ko samqsaqram to tuxoungteq, Peter to, “kaishih ka manneq yantah. Nangqngeq teihpaq nox khüonyakram mong teihlhangga geithibabix Younggan mongteih mantlhangq!” leq shihleq ku weq günq.<verse eid="MRK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8.34 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:38">Mat 10.38</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:27">Luk 14.27</ref> </char>
    </note>Gapheimaq Jesu weq benyuqsa geithungteq ko Samqsaqram ku geto nyark. Geithuphi, “kokao kaphei to goixya tuebanox kum meq maxmax lakkünx geithungteq kum meq lakteiq pailah geithungteq kaphei to goixkei. <verse eid="MRK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:39">Mat 10.39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:33">Luk 17.33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:25">Jhn 12.25</ref></char></note>Chamleixma thibaq aoweq maxmax agang gangngax tux ü ngeihleq ku mah ao; geithibao aoweq ka ginxlhakka geithungteq gaanrangx komei ginxlhakka maxmax agang mah a koh, ku gangngaox. <verse eid="MRK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36" />Khüonyak keq kahgannyuq rap mokkungte maxmax agang mah a kohbaq kum meq cham konyei takka? Koyingx maq mant takkaox! <verse eid="MRK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37" />Gamaq ku weq agang jamq tak kathuq ginxlhakka jajage mantteix. <verse eid="MRK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38" />Chamleixma thiba khüonyak kokao weq ka ginxlhakka, geithungteq gapaq nyuxjishakpa yinx maq ka ngaox ginxlhakka, thagün banox, mojuxmaq koyaoq paq angkhüo monxtanx param phi kopaq miktuxthantaq mei maq ku yuxwaox ngeihleq khüonyak kosaq eq ku thagün naqkoh aox” leq ku weq kum to günq.<verse eid="MRK 8:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1" />Geithungteq ku weq kum toq, “Koyingx maq Koi yeq nümx to günqnu, Younggan angchingq gongxphi peipaq mongant mongant leq kokao amaq yong leq tiparam mant rix yaox,” leq günq.<verse eid="MRK 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Leixjijeix Paq</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-13">Matthew 17.1–13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luke 9.28–36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2" />Geithungteq<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 1:17">2 Pet 1.17</ref>,<ref loc="2PE 1:18">18</ref></char></note> nyih agok phaimaq Jesuweq Peter, James geithungteq John ko phi lah, geithungteq kahtoq to kum goixleq zongq, ga maq kum jaaleq teix, Kum mikthao maq ku rap jeixjileix, <verse eid="MRK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3" />Geithungteq ko khuq meilangleq yapjinan leq thaoq. Kahgannyuq maq aoweq yaoxbix gagonx leq thaoqleq hox waq mantzok. <verse eid="MRK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4" />Gapheimaq Samqsaqram aram thaomaq Elijah ji Mosa peileq Jesu phi gingpaq ngant. <verse eid="MRK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5" />Gajux maq Peter e ngaox ngaix geithungteq Jesu to, “Nüoqpaq, kim amaq jongpaq meilang meitatao! komx meq amaq khuqpümpx aramleq güikekhah, na a jaq, Mosa a jaq, geithungteq Elijah a jaaleq” leq günq. <verse eid="MRK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6" />Ku geithungteq amungram meilangleq gax, geithungteq kuweq champhangx günnaleq yaox manttingx.<verse eid="MRK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 3:17">Mat 3.17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:11">Mrk 1.11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:22">Luk 3.22</ref></char>
    </note>Gajux maq angphom ngaiq geithungteq kum to ku angkhux phi lum, geithungteq angphom manneq ngaox jaq pei, “Aga nox ka monglungxsaq ngeih, ko ngaox tanxlah!” <verse eid="MRK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8" />Gajux maq Kum meq ngeihleq tux geithibabix jajage hangant; Jesu jaq gaq leq kum phi teix.<verse eid="MRK 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9" />Kum kahtoq manneq leihleq tijux maq, Jesuweq kumtoq aga ngaox koh, “Khüonyak kosaq rixpaq manneq gangleq moleih moleihleq, Nümx meq champopogi ngant, goiq aotobix tha günq” leq günq.<verse eid="MRK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10" />Kum meq ko ngaox kohpaq tanxleq teix, geithibao kum ba maq gaga jux, “Rixpaq manneq gangleq leih ao leq cham to lebpu?” leq günqnaq koki gangq. <verse eid="MRK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:14">Mat 11.14</ref> </char></note> Geithungteq kummeq, “Chamleimaq ngaoxhung nüopaq ram meq Elijah agangngax yukolah leq günqnula?” leq Jesu to kih.<verse eid="MRK 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12" />Jesu weq, “Lhangnguq pangqge singxjimingx nga Elijah agangxngax yux kolahngeih, geithibao laiq ngaox weq khüonyak kosaq thangxngaox geithungteq mant lah aoleq chamleixmaq günqnuq? <verse eid="MRK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13" />Thibabix koi yeq nümx to günqnu ngeih, Elijah nox pei taga, geithuphix laiq ngaox weq ko ginxlhakka champhangx günq gaga jaq unxneq khüonyak ram meq kum meq beiqyenneq ringqngax tue gaga jaunneq kotoq ringq ngung ga” leq lox.<verse eid="MRK 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Konyux Lhasaq Tipaq Naopaq jaq Jesu weq Meiqleq Koh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-21">Matthew 17.14–21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43a">Luke 9.37–43a</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14" />Mojux maq amungq Samqsaqram geto kum pei, benyuqsa meilang nge kum to ngeihleq heih paq kum meq ngant, ngaoxhung nüopaq ram kukaoqweq kum phi ging. <verse eid="MRK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15" />Mojux maq khüonyak ram meq Jesu ngant, kum meilangleq bart geithungteq kogika phat geithungteq kotoq saqlamx koh. <verse eid="MRK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16" />Jesu weq ko Samsaram to, “Kum phi nümx meq cham jux gingnguq?” leq kih.<verse eid="MRK 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17" />Benyuqsa tanx maoq khüonyak jeiqyeq, “Nüopaq, koi yeq naq geto ka saq goixleq peileq titao, chamleixmaqthibaq ku maq ko nyux lhasaq teix geithuphi ku ging ngaq mantzok. <verse eid="MRK 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18" />Mojux maq konyux lhaxsaq e kutoq tamx muq, ku kahgan khüoyuh toi, geithungteq chun maq laixbüok ngai, ku gax gunq, geithungteq noqjinga ayax. Koi yeq naq samsaram to konyux lhaxsaq jangxleq paoxphaleq günq, geithibabix kum meq jangxngax mantzok” leq lox.<verse eid="MRK 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19" />Gajux maq Jesu weq kum to, “Nümx koyingx hateih param yinx! Ka nümx phi aogonx lao leq jongngaxla? Ka nümx phi aogonx shumleq jong zokka? Naopaq ka geto peikei!” leq günq. <verse eid="MRK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20" />Geithuphi Kum meq Jesu geto Naopaq lahleq pei.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:20">Konyux Lhaxsaq e Jesu ngantnu phi goih e naopaq lhaq maq tamx, ku kahgan yu yax chun manneq laixbüok ngaixleq lapjikhaple toi. <verse eid="MRK 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21" />Jesu weq kopaq to, “Agaunneq ngai paq ku aogonx maq ngoiphei?” leq kih.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:21">Ku paq weq, “Ku Naosaq kamanneqngeih, <verse eid="MRK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22" />meilang maq konyux lhaxsaq e langxngaxleq, günq maq shunxnax leq, sungx maq pinxnaleq gongxngungeih, geithibao nangqngeq zokbanox yoyopha geithungteq taohphaq,” leq lox.<verse eid="MRK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23" />Jesu weq kutoq, “Zokkaox nangqngeq koyingxleq teihbanox, aoweq koyingxleq teih gaga a pangqge zokkaox,” leq gunq.<verse eid="MRK 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24" />Naopaq kopaq e peileiye jingqgark, “Koi yeq koyingxleq teihleq mongoungtao koyingx hateih zokpa kar to taohphaq!” leq günq.<verse eid="MRK 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25" />Benyuqsa kum geto pei ü Jesu weq tingx, geithuphi ku weq Konyux Lhaxsaq to, “Naxbopaq geithungteq ngaox akpaq Lhaxsaq kugenq, aga naopaq manneq paotah geithungteq kogimaq mojux maq bix jam thanyap!” leq shihleq günq.<verse eid="MRK 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26" />Gentxshark leq konyux Lhaxsaq ngaox naopaq thangx leq tahoungteq ku ngai. Naopaq mang nganxneq ngant, geithuphi khüonyak rappoiq ye, “Ku rix taga!” leq ging. <verse eid="MRK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27" />Geithibabix Jesu weq naopaq lhakmaq tamxleq ronx leq raoqwa koh geithuphi ku youngq.<verse eid="MRK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28" />Mojuxmaq Jesu Kamp kha to nyep, ko Samqsaqram meq, “Chamleimaq kommeq konyux lhaxsaq jangxleq paoxwa hazokkuq?” leq ronxleq kih.<verse eid="MRK 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29" />Jesu weq; “Amungq jajageyeq mant zok, angphung nge galeq zokkaox” leq lox.<verse eid="MRK 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu weq Ku Rixyathuq jux Chambix Günq</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22">Matthew 17.22</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 17:23">23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43b-45">Luke 9.43b–45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30" />Kum meq gaga lung tah geithungteq Galilee lenxleq pao. Jesu weq ku jongpaq lung aotobix tingxngax hakoh, <verse eid="MRK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31" />Chamleixma thiba ku weq Samqsaqram to honxnüoqleq jong. “Kum meq ku langxngax thuq ginxlhakka khüonyak ram lhak maq yanleq koh ao. Geithibabix nyih aram phaimaq ku gangleq leih ao,” leq ku weq kum to günq.<verse eid="MRK 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32" />Geithibabix kum meq mant tingx ku weq nüopaq, geithungteq gaga kotoq kih a yaoxbix kum gax.<verse eid="MRK 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kobohpaq Aongeih?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Matthew 18.1–5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luke 9.46–48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33" />Mojux maq Kum Capernaum ngoi, geithungteq Kamp maq peipheimaq Jesu weq ko Samqsaqram to, “Nümx lüm maq kamq juxmaq jam jux günqleq gingnguq?” leq kih.<verse eid="MRK 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.34 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 22:24">Luk 22.24</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Geithibabix kum zangxyo leq jong, Chamleixma thiba kum lüm maq tijux maq Kobohpaq aongeih leq gingleq kamq. <verse eid="MRK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 20:26">Mat 20.26</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 20:27">27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 23:11">23.11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:43">Mrk 10.43</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 10:44">44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:26">Luk 22.26</ref></char></note>Jesu jong geithungteq Samsaram banxbaanyix to nyarkleq, “Aopangqnge thaogun to lung ku khoih leq tahpaq ax sholheix yung, geithungteq rappoq thaothoqpaq a sholheix yung,” leq günq. <verse eid="MRK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36" />Geithungteq ku weq nao jaq goixleq peix kum muhthaoqmaq youngngax koh. Naosaq ku lhak maq paiyungteq kum to, <verse eid="MRK 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:40">Mat 10.40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:16">Luk 10.16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:20">Jhn 13.20</ref> </char></note>“Ao weq ka münx maq agaunneq tipaq Naosaq lah oungeih leq ku weq kar bix lah ü ngeih. Geithungteq aopangngeq ka lah, ka jaq lah ü mantlhangq geithibabix aoweq ka pongx, kubix lah u ngeih,” leq günq.<verse eid="MRK 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aopangq Kim Phix toktei leq Hayongq, Kum Kimphuxngeih</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:49">Luke 9.49</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 9:50">50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38" />John neq kutoq, “Nüoqpaq naq münx maq konyux Lhaxsaq jangx paq khüonyak jaq kommeq nganttao, geithungteq kommeq kotoq raktah leq günphei, Chamleixma thiba ku nox kimphux mantlhangq” leq günq.<verse eid="MRK 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39" />Geithibabix Jesu weq kum to, “Kotoq rakka thakoh, chamleixmaqthibaq kar münx maq Kahhonxangmanx mokkungte peileiye ka to komox pha athuq aoyaox mant tei, leq günq. <verse eid="MRK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:30">Mat 12.30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:23">Luk 11.23</ref></char></note>Chamleixma thiba aopangq kim phi toktei leq hayongq, kubix kim phungeih. <verse eid="MRK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:42">Mat 10.42</ref></char></note>Koi yeq koyingx maq nümx to günqnu ngeih, kokao weq nümx khrista ginlhak leq teihleq jiekongx ruh jaq yaox pha banox kuweq gaga that hingxhox takkaox.<verse eid="MRK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Konyux Ommaq Tokpaq</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-9">Matthew 18.6–9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1">Luke 17.1</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 17:2">2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42" />“Kar to koyingxleq teihpaq agaram beetanx maoq koripsaq jaq lhangbabix aoweq lapjilei leq konyux ommaq koh ü ngeih leq ko ginxlhakka thamqshuq longqkhüo koboh jaq zingqmaq yik leq sungxkha yuh singpaq shimei. <verse eid="MRK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:30">Mat 5.30</ref></char></note>Geithuyaoxweq naq lhak keq lapleq ya a pha banox gax chihleq jarkkoh! lhak anyix phi galomaq hamatpa mologünq to kaaqleiq manox lhakshukpa a lhangleq agang chingq to zongqpaq semei. <verse eid="MRK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" pubnumber="[44]" sid="MRK 9:44" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.44 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kokao lhakgoxlaiq maq lhaakpaq 44: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">gamaq kumtoq shahpaq lhongq jam mant rix, geithungteq kumtoq shunpaq günq bix jamq mant mat leq; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">maq heixleq tah leq titao (lhaakpaq 48 maq ngant naox).</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45" />Geithungteq naq lhaq e naq lapleq ya a pha banox chihleq jark koh! lhaq moinye phix mologünq maq shunleixleix nox lhaq hati yeq agang chingq to zongq paq semei. <verse eid="MRK 9:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" pubnumber="[46]" sid="MRK 9:46" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kokao lhakgoxlaiq maq lhaakpaq 46: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">gamaq kumtoq shahpaq lhongq jamq mant rix, geithungteq kumtoq shunpaq günq bix jam mant matle; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">maq heixleq tah leq titao (lhaakpaq 48 maq ngant naox).</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.47 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:29">Mat 5.29</ref> </char></note>Geithungteq naq mikkeq naq konyux maq yaq a pha banox lokleq jarkkoh! Mik anyix phi mologünq to kaqleixleixnox mik jaq hatiyeq Younggan angchingq to zongqpaq semei. <verse eid="MRK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48" />Gaga maq kumtoq shah a thuq lhongq mojux mabix mant rix geithungteq günq mojux maq bix mant mat.<verse eid="MRK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49" />“Chamleixma thiba tumq meq langq leq yaoqleq shomxjito kohpaq jaunneq khüonyak ram rappoq günq phi yaoq leq kohaox.<verse eid="MRK 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.50 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:13">Mat 5.13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:34">Luk 14.34</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 14:35">35</ref></char>
    </note>“Tumq nox meiyu; geithibao ku weq ku maq tipaq kojumx hambanox nangqngeq beiqyenneq jamq chumpaq a ringqleq koh a?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 9:50">“Nümx maq tumq tiyinx, geithungteq nümx bamaq chingqmeix tilah.”<verse eid="MRK 9:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10" />
  <para style="s">Shoqyanpaq jux Jesu weq Nüoq</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:1-12">Matthew 19.1–12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luke 16.18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1" />Gaphei maq Jesu gaga lung tahoungteq lhaq yong, geithungteq Jordan sungxyinx kaileq Judea gaankamx to pao. Jambix benyuqsa ko geto heih geithungteq banlam jaunneq kuweq kum to nüoq.<verse eid="MRK 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2" />Ku geto pharase ram kokao pei geithungteq kotoq tonlamq, “Komx to su günq tux, khüonyak jeiq yeq maxmax sanyuq yanxnathuq kim ngaoxhung maq ti ü jea?” leq kih.<verse eid="MRK 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3" />Jesu weq kum to, “Mosa ngaoxhung nge nümx to jamq münxneq pha tao?” leq kih oungteq lox.<verse eid="MRK 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10.4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:31">Mat 5.31</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Kum meq, “yannathuq laiq gox oungteq sanyuq phi yannan leq, Mosa ngaox maq tiu” Leq agaunneq lox.<verse eid="MRK 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5" />Geithibabix Jesu weq kum to, “Nümx to nüo a thuq ginxlhakka, meilang kea ü leixmaq Mosa e gapaq ngaoxhung gox. <verse eid="MRK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6" />Geithibabix, Laiq ngaox maq günqnu wenneq, ‘Agangxngax Younggan neq ringq jux kuleq, kum mihnyu mihpaleq ringq’ leq titao. <verse eid="MRK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7" />‘Geithuyaox weq khüonyak jeiqyeq ko paq ji ko nyu tahoungteq ko sanyuq<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kokao lhak ke goxpaq laiq mantteix </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ko sanyuq phi jaq a lheixyaox.</char></note> phi jaq a lheixyaox, <verse eid="MRK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8" />Geithungteq konyix jaq a lhangngaox. Geithuyao weq kum atanox anyixya mantlhangq thibabix jaq.’ <verse eid="MRK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9" />Geithuphi, champopoge Youngganneq heih a koh, gapaq khüonyakkeq yan naq thakoh” leq günq.<verse eid="MRK 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10" />Mojux maq kum kamp ka leihleq pei, Samsaram meq Jesu to gapaq jux kih. <verse eid="MRK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.11,12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:32">Mat 5.32</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 7:10">1 Kor 7.10</ref>,<ref loc="1CO 7:11">11</ref></char></note>Geithuphi kuweq kum to, “Khüonyak aoweq maxmax sanyuq phi yan geithungteq amungq sanyuq lah oh ngeih leq, ku weq maxmax sanyuq phi tokteileq shophungqngungtao. <verse eid="MRK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12" />Gajaq unneq ü, sanyuq aoweq ko sapaq phi yan geithungteq amungq Sapaq phi shongq, shophungqngungtao” leq günq.<verse eid="MRK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu weq Sashih Ram to Thaomeix Koh</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Matthew 19.13–15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luke 18.15–17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13" />Khüonyak kokaoweq Jesu geto kuweq kumtoq lhak shingleq napha leq sashihram lahleq peix, geithibaoq Samqsaqram meq khüonyak to shih. <verse eid="MRK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14" />Geithibaoq mojux maq Jesu weq gax ngant, ku mongkhah ngai geithungteq ko Samsaram to, “Sashih ram ka geto pei ya koh unx! kum to thabang, Chamleixma thiba Younggan angchingq nox agaram münxneq tipaq ginlhak ka ngeih. <verse eid="MRK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:3">Mat 18.3</ref></char></note>Koi yeq nümx to koyingx maq günqnu ngeih, aoweq naosaq unxneq lhangleq Younggan angchingq halah, gato zongqngax mant zokkaox” leq günq. <verse eid="MRK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16" />Gapheimaq kuweq naosaq ram paileq lah, kum khüo gah maq ku lhak shingx geithungteq kum to thaomei koh.<verse eid="MRK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lungngangq Paq Khüonyak</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Matthew 19.16–30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luke 18.18–30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17" />Geithungteq Jesu lüm maq kamleq tijux maq, khüonyak jaq phatleq ngoi, ku muhthaoq maq lhakuhsuq geithungteq kutoq, “Nüopa komei, kobakhatipa agang tak kathu ginlhak ka koi yeq champhangx ringq ngax la?” leq kih.<verse eid="MRK 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18" />Jesu weq ko to, “Nangqngeq chamleixma kar to komei leq nyarkkuq?” leq kih. “Aobix komei mant teix; Younggan jaq ga ngeih. <verse eid="MRK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19" />Nangq nge ngaoxhung tingxpheishih: ‘Tha langx, sophungq thahonx, thakuh, alab saqkiq thagün, thalüo, tharoi, geithungteq naq nyuq ji naq paq to ojisholah.’ ”<verse eid="MRK 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20" />Kuweq kotoq, “Nüopaq, kar saqshih ka manxneq leq gaga ngaoxhung lahleq pei ü” leq günq.<verse eid="MRK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21" />Lung ngophi Jesu weq kotoq tinglingqleq tux leq, “Naq jagejamaq mongoi. Leih unx geithungteq naq a tipaq rapleq tangqkoh geithungteq taishih ram to ngunq koh unx, geithuphi angkhüo maq naq lungqngang lhangngaox; gapheimaq peikei geithungteq kaq phei to goixkei” leq günq. <verse eid="MRK 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22" />Mojux maq kuweq gaga ngaox tanx, ko thannyak geithungteq mongmoleq pao, Chamleixma thiba ku meilangleq lungngangq.<verse eid="MRK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23" />Jesu weq ko Samsaram to tuxleq pongx geithungteq kum to, “Lungngangq param Younggan angchingq to zongq ngathuq ginxlhakka aogonxleq kea ü!” leq günq.<verse eid="MRK 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24" />Gapaq ngaox to Samsaram bart, geithibaoq Jesu weq kum to harakkeq, “Kaq saqram, Younggan angchingq to zongngathuq aogonx kea ü! <verse eid="MRK 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25" />Lungngangq paq jaq Younggan angchingq to zongqnguq phenox münxlhamq khaka mok leqpaq selhon” leq günq.<verse eid="MRK 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26" />Gaga paq ngaox tantleq kum rap khampungxlob geithungteq kum meq jaqjaq to, “Geithibanox aopopoq gang zokka?” leq kih.<verse eid="MRK 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27" />Jesu weq kum to tux geithungteq, “Aganox khüonyak ram meq mant zokkaox, geithibaoq Younggan ginxlhakka mant kea, Younggan ginlhak ka pangqge zokkaox” leq günq.<verse eid="MRK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28" />Gaphaimaq Peter e agaunneq, “Tuxwen, kommeq rap tah geithungteq naq phei to goix ü” leq günq.<verse eid="MRK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29" />Jesu weq kum to, “Koyingx, koi yeq nümx to günqnu ngeih, aopangngeq ka ginxlhakka geithungteq Gaanrangx komei ginxlhakka Kamp, geihalhangba maxmax jei ji nao, maxmax nyaq ji nao geihalhangba ko nyuq ji ko paq geihalhangba saqram geihalhangba kah tah-ungeih, <verse eid="MRK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30" />aga paq kagannyuq maq meilang takkaox, kuweq gokbanx phi nyeiqleq maxmax jei ji nao ram, nyaq ji nao ram, nyuqram, saqram geithungteq kah takkaox, geithungteq thangxpong paq bix takkaox, geithungteq pei athu yinx ginxlhakka kuweq kobakhatipa agang takkaox. <verse eid="MRK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 20:16">Mat 20.16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:30">Luk 13.30</ref> </char></note>Geithibaoq aleq aopangq meilangleq thaogun naq teix, phei kax a lheixyaox, geithungteq aleq phei kax a tiparam thaogun naq lheixyaox” leq günq.<verse eid="MRK 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu weq Ku Rixyathuq jux Arampaq Günq.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Matthew 20.17–19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luke 18.31–34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32" />Kum Jerusalem to zongq paq lüm maq teix, geithuphi Samsaram thaoq Jesu weq gunq, kum mong bart, geithungteq kum pheitoq goixpaq khüonyak ram gax. Jesu weq jam ku samqsaqram banxba anyix goixleq paox geithungteq kotoq jam ngai a ngeih gapaq jux günq. <verse eid="MRK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33" />Jesu weq kum to, “Powenx, kim Jerusalem to zongq ngungeih, ayungmaq ngungxpaq eikhungram geithungteq ngaoxhung nüopa ram to khüonyak kosaq yanx leq koh ao. Kum meq ku rix yathuq ginxlhakka yaoqwaox geithungteq ku günqringramq to yanx leq kohaox. <verse eid="MRK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34" />Kum meq kotoq yaiwaox, kotoq chuhon phi thonxnaox, kotoq phettaox, geithungteq ku langxngaox; Geithibabix nyih aram leq jongngungqteq ku gangleq leihaoq” leq günq.<verse eid="MRK 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">James ji Johnneq Yupaq</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:20-28">Matthew 20.20–28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35" />Gapheimaq Zebedee ko saq James ji John nyix Jesu geto pei. Ku nyix yeq, “Nüopaq nangqngeq kar nyix ginlhak kaq jageja ringqleq phakei!” leq günq.<verse eid="MRK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36" />Jesu weq konyix to, “Nanyix ginxlhakka koi yeq champhangx ringqleq pha a tue tao?” leq kih.<verse eid="MRK 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37" />Kum meq, “Mojux maq naq miktuxthantaxmei angchingq maq jongngaox leq, naq lhakmei lheiq maq jaq, lhakshih lheiq maq jaqleq kar nyix bix jongngax phakei” leq lox.<verse eid="MRK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38" />Geithibaoq <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:50">Luk 12.50</ref></char></note>Jesu weq, “Cham ginxlhakka yu ü, naq nyix yeq manttingx. Koi yeq ying ngathu thangxshih ruh naq nyix yeq yingngax zokkaya? geithungteq koiyeq baptix yathu wenxneq, ka Baptixpaq maq naq nyix bix zokkaya?” leq lox.<verse eid="MRK 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39" />Kum meq, “zokkaox” leq lox.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:39">Jesu weq, “Naq nyix yeq koi yingnguq ruh yingngax zok geithungteq koiyeq Baptixpa unxneq baptiyax zokkaox lhangngaox. <verse eid="MRK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40" />Geithibaoq, kaq lhakmei lheiqmaq geihalhangba lhakshih lheiqmaq jongngax rünqnaq thunox kaq maq gongx mant teix. Gaphangx lungnox aopangq ginxlhakka shingx Youngganneq gaq leq phakeox” leq günq.<verse eid="MRK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41" />Mojux maq amungq Samsaram banxneq gapaq ngaox tanx, James ji John nyix to kum mongpüok. <verse eid="MRK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.42,43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 22:25">Luk 22.25</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:26">26</ref></char></note>Geithuphi Jesu weq kum rap goih e nyark geithungteq aga unxneq, “Nümx meq tingxphei aopangq to ngaoxkextampa rammaq rünq, ganring ram gah maq kum taihung ngeih, geithungteq kum monxchongtampaq ram to kum gah maoqram meq gongx tamx mungeih. <verse eid="MRK 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.43,44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:11">Mat 23.11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:35">Mrk 9.35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:26">Luk 22.26</ref></char></note>Gaga unxneq tibabix nümx betanx maq galeq thalhang. Nümx kokao weq koboh a lheixyax tue banox, ku amungq ram thaothoq paq a solheix yungq; <verse eid="MRK 10:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44" />Geithungteq nümx betanx maq kokao agangx nga lheix yaq tue banox, ku raoh zaa a sulheix yungq. <verse eid="MRK 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45" />Chamleixma thiba khüonyak kosaq yaox bix thaothoqleq napha keileq pei ü mantlhangq; geithibaoq thaothoq a thuq ginlhakkax ku pei geithungteq ko agang kohleq khüonyak meilang hun nathuq thatmaq pei” leq günq.<verse eid="MRK 10:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu weq Mik Züwkpaq Bartimaeus Mei</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Matthew 20.29–34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luke 18.35–43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46" />Geithungteq kum Jericho to pei. Jesu Samqsaqram phi geithungteq benyuqsa meilang phi Jericho manneq pao jux maq, Timaeus kosaq jei Bartimaeus leq münxpaq mikzüok paq jaq lüm jen maq jongleq shahyuleq teix. <verse eid="MRK 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47" />Mojux maq kuweq aganox Nazareth mao Jesu leq tanx, kuweq, “David kosaq! Jesu! kaq to yoyopha” leq chingqgarkka yax.<verse eid="MRK 10:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48" />Rohabeih e jongngathuq ginlhakkax khüonyak ram rappeq kotoq shih. Geithibaoq kuweq, “David kosaqjei Jesu! kaq to yoyo pha” leq segongq leq chingpgark.<verse eid="MRK 10:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49" />Jesu rak geithungteq, “kotoq nyarkkün” kuweq günq.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:49">Geithuphi kum meq mik zaok paq to nyark leq, “Mongmeitah! yongqtah, kuweq naq to nyark tiga” leq günq.<verse eid="MRK 10:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50" />Kuweq kokhuq shinx leq shupleq tah, geithuphi Jesu geto phatleq pei.<verse eid="MRK 10:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51" />Jesu weq, “Koiyeq naq ginlhak ka cham ringqleq pha a tue tao?” leq ku to kih.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:51">Mikzaok paq e, “Nüopa, koiyeq ngantnaq tue tao” leq lox.<verse eid="MRK 10:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52" />Jesu weq, “leihtah, nangq nge koyingteih u weq naq meitaga” leq ko to günq.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 10:52">Gajux maq oh leq kuweq ngant nazok, geithuphi ku Jesu phi lüm maq goix.<verse eid="MRK 10:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11" />
  <para style="s">Jerusalem to Zok leq Zongqpaq</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Matthew 21.1–11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luke 19.28–40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">John 12.12–19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1" />Mojux maq kum olive kahtoq ka leq Bethphage ji Bethany lheiq manneq Jerusalem to shohleq pei, Jesu weq ko samqsaqram anyixleq thaoq lheiq ka pongx. <verse eid="MRK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2" />Aga ngaox phi, “Nümx thaomaq tingxkhakleq tipaq chingq to zongngant nümx ngoi yuphix goiheq mojux maq bix aoyaox mojong paq müanx pongsaq nümx meq tor leq ngant keox, gaga zo unx geithungteq amaq peikei. <verse eid="MRK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3" />Kokao weq nümx to, ‘Aga nümx meq jam max leq kih banox?’ Agaunxneq günnanx, ‘Taihungpaq<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.3 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Taihungpaq; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">geihalhangba </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Kamp popaq.</char></note> to aga kopong lhangga geithungteq aga peileix ye leihphaox’ leq günq nanx” leq kuweq günq.<verse eid="MRK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4" />Geithuphi kum pao geithungteq lüm nyuq jen maq tipaq Kamp jaq lungkaxjong maq müanx pongsaq tor leq teix, geithuphi kum meq gaga zor. <verse eid="MRK 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5" />Kokao yong leq tiparam meq kum to, “Müanx pongsaq zor leq nümx meq jam ringq nguq?” leq kih.<verse eid="MRK 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6" />Gajux maq Jesu weq kum to beiq unxneq günq gaga unxneq lox, gaphei maq khüonyak ram meq kum pao waq koh. <verse eid="MRK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7" />Kum meq Jesu geyuh Müanx pongsaq lahleq peix ga khüo maq kum khuq nyamx Jesu ga khüo maq jongq. <verse eid="MRK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8" />Khüonyak meilang nge kum khuq lüm maq nyamx gajux maq kokao weq Rok kangq hatleq lüm maq nyamx leq koh. <verse eid="MRK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9" />Aopangq khüonyak muhthaoq maq kamq geithungteq tokphei lheiq maq goix leq chingqgark, “Kohoq paq maq Hosanna! Taihungpaq münx maq aopei kotoq Youngganpaq e thaomei yenx! <verse eid="MRK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10" />Kim apaq David angchingq pei yathu to Youngganneq thaomei yenx! Kohoq paq maq Younggan to münxboh koh unx!” leq günq.<verse eid="MRK 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11" />Jesu Jerusalem to nyep, geithungteq Shomxkamp to zongq, geithungteq pangqge to ngeihleq tux leq pongx. Geithibaoq ginlhak phei ü leixmaq ko Samsaram banxba anyixyu phi bethany kaq leih.<verse eid="MRK 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Phokpün to Jesu weq Hai paq</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:18">Matthew 21.18</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 21:19">19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12" />Jampa nyih mojux maq Bethany manneq kum leih Jesu wa nonxnga, <verse eid="MRK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13" />Toxkah kuweq phoknyuq pün jaq meilangleq kulhak nguit leq ngant, geithuphi gamaq koreak tiyaleq tux waq ku raq, geithibaoq mojux maq ku pün jongka peiyeqleq raleq tux kolhak gaq nguit tungteq jajage hateix; Chamleixma thiba gajux maq phok reak jux halhang. <verse eid="MRK 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14" />Gajux maq Jesuweq phok pün to, “Naq mao koreak aoweq bix cham thashah!” leq günq.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 11:14">Geithuphi Samqsaqram meq kuweq günqpaq ngaox tanx.<verse eid="MRK 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Weq Shomxkamp to Pao</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Matthew 21.12–17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luke 19.45–48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">John 2.13–22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15" />Mojux maq kum Jerusalem ngoi Shomxkamp maq Jesu nyep, geithungteq maq tangparam ji shak param meilangleq changx leq paox. Kuweq ngunq leipaq tabkhung ji Aohu tangpaq ram kohung thokleq jark, <verse eid="MRK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16" />Shomxkamp mongka aobix monx küntleq peiya hakoh. <verse eid="MRK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17" />Gapheimaq ku weq khüonyak ram to nüo: “Laiq ngaox maq aga unxneq goxleq tiü, ‘Kaq Kamp nox jatjigeq ram rappoq ginxlhakka angphung kampleq nyark kao leq goxleq teix.’ Geithibao aga nümx meq akuhram ronx lungngax ringqleq koh!” leq günq.<verse eid="MRK 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18" />Ngungxpaq eikhungram ngaoxhung nüopaq ram meq gaga tanx, gaphei maq Jesu langxngax thuq mongteih kum meq lümq, Kotoq kum gax, Chamleixma thiba benyuqsa rappoiyeq kuweq nüopaq to khampungxlob.<verse eid="MRK 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19" />Mojux maq günx pongx ngoi Jesu ji ko Samsaram noknyuq tahoungteq pao.<verse eid="MRK 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Phoknyu Pün maq Tingxngathuq</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:20-22">Matthew 21.20–22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20" />Jamqpaq nüp homx maq kum lüm maq leq jux maq phokpün kuko yuh manneq rixpaq ngant. <verse eid="MRK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21" />Peter e teihleq tak geithungteq Jesu to, “Nüopaq, tuxwen nangqngeq hai paq phokpün rix taga!” leq günq.<verse eid="MRK 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22" />Jesu weq kum to, “Nümx meq Younggan to koyingxleq teihlah. <verse eid="MRK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23" />Nümx meq aga kahtoq to günq baq zokkaox nyuntah geithungteq nalhungxlhungxka geenyuq yu yatah. Nümx mongkha maq toitai yuq hateix geithibao nangqngeq günqnu ngai keox leq <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 17:20">Mat 17.20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 13:2">1 Kor 13.2</ref> </char></note>koyingx maq teih banox aga nümx to ringq pha waox. <verse eid="MRK 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24" />Geithuyao weq koiyeq nümx to günqnu mojux maq nümx maq angphung, geithungteq kolamx jaq ginxlhakka yubanox gaga nümx meq takkaoxleq koyingxleq teihlah geithungteq gaga rappoq nümx to phawaox. <verse eid="MRK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.25,26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 6:14">Mat 6.14</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 6:15">15</ref></char></note>Geithungteq nümx meq mojux maq youngleq angphung, kokao phi toxjipan leq tibanox gaga to konyux sejarkkungq, geithiba galeq angkhüo maq tipaq nümx Apaq e nümx konyux bix jark kaox” leq günq. <verse eid="MRK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" pubnumber="[26]" sid="MRK 11:26" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kokao lhakgoxlaiq maq lhark paq 26 maq: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">nümx meq maxmungq ram konyux hajark banox, angkhüo mao naq paq e naq konyux mant jarkkaoxleq baoxpaq titao, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">(</char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 6:15">Mat 6.15</ref></char> maq tuxwen).</note><verse eid="MRK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Gongx Jux Kihpaq</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Matthew 21.23–27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luke 20.1–8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27" />Jamqbix kum Jerusalem to pei, geithungteq Jesu Shomxkamp maq kamq leq tijux maq ngungxpaq eikhungram ngaoxhung nüoparam geithungteq nyakmeiram koge to pei <verse eid="MRK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28" />Geithungteq ko to, “Gaphangx ringqngathuq ginxlhakka naq maq jampopoge gongx tiü? Galehalhangbaq gaphangx ringqngax thuq ginxlhakka gongx naq to aoweq pha ü?” leq kih.<verse eid="MRK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29" />Jesu weq kum to, “Koi yeq nümx to jaq kih phakhah, geithungteq nümx meq gaga shao khak leq lox banox, jam gongx phi koiyeq monx mok leq nümx to günq phakhah. <verse eid="MRK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30" />Kar to günq pha, Baptixpaq John angkhüo mao jea, geihalhangba khüonyak ram beemaoq?” leq lox.<verse eid="MRK 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31" />Kum bamaq kum lhongx lhongx ka aga unxneq ging, “Kim meq beiq unxneq günqna? ‘Younggan maoqleq günq banox,’ nümx meq ‘Chamleixmaq John to koyingx hateih ü?’ <verse eid="MRK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32" />Geithibao kim meq khüonyak maoqleq günq banox,” (khüonyakram thox kum gax, Chamleixma thiba John nox ashipaq jaqleq rappeq tingx.) <verse eid="MRK 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33" />Geithuweyeq kum meq Jesu to, “Kommeq manttingx,” leq lox.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 11:33">Geithuphi Jesu weq kum to, “Geithibanox koiyeq cham gongx phi gaphangx mok, koi yeq bix nümx to mant günq” leq günq.<verse eid="MRK 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12" />
  <para style="s">Gureak Kah Teiqparam maq Ngaox Leppaq</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Matthew 21.33–46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luke 20.9–19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1" />Geithuphi Jesu weq kum to ngaox leppaq maq günq: “Ginlhak jaqmaq gureak kah kah paq khüonyak jaqleq teix, Kah ngeihleq paan güi, gureak naktak gom thaoq geithungteq gaantux po jaq güi, gaphei maq kah teiqparam lhak maq gureak kah tahoungteq gunq to pao. <verse eid="MRK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2" />Mojux maq gureak khaiq yathuq jux ngoi, koshoitamx lah a thuq ginxlhakka kah teiqparam geyuh zapaq jaq pongx. <verse eid="MRK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3" />Geithibaoq kah teiqparam meq zapaq lüoq, kotoq phet, geithungteq akungx maq kunt naq koh. <verse eid="MRK 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4" />Gapheimaq Kamp popaq e kum geyuh amungq zapaq jaq jaiq, kahteiqpaqram meq kokhaoq kax phet geithungteq thagün naxkoh. <verse eid="MRK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5" />Kopopaq e amungq zapaq jaq pongx, geithuphi kum meq gajei langx, gamanq maq maxmungram meilangleq ku weq pongx; kokao to phet kokao langx. <verse eid="MRK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6" />Atanox jaq jagaleq chax geithungteq gaga nox ko monglungxsaq. Ku weq aleq günq, ‘koi yeq tingxngungtaoq kummeq agatopanox oxji am keox.’ Gapheimaq koka a ku weq kah teiparam geyuh kosaq kanx. <verse eid="MRK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7" />Geithibaoq, kah teiparam meq aga unxneq jaqjaq phi kanxgungx, ‘Aganox kopopaq kosaq, kei kimmeq ku langx khah, geithungteq kim ko chaamhaiq a lheixkhah!’ <verse eid="MRK 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8" />Geithuphi kummeq ku lah geithungteq ku langx, geithungteq komang gureak kah kaileq jark.”<verse eid="MRK 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9" />Jesu weq, “Geithibanox gureak kah kopopaq e chamringngax?” leq kih. “Ku peiyaox geithungteq kah teiparam langxngaox geithungteq gureak kah amungq ram to koh ao. <verse eid="MRK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10" />Koyingx maq nümx meq laiq ngaox iex yuq ya nye?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">“ ‘Kamp güi param meq jampopogeq longq halah</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:10">gaga paq kampthongx longqnyuq wa lheix;<verse eid="MRK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11" />Aganox Taihung nge ringqpaq,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:11">aganox komx mik thaomaq khampungxlop phangxpaq!’ ” leq günq.<verse eid="MRK 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12" />Jehudiram eikhung rammeq Jesu lüoq a ngang Chamleixma thiba aga ngaoxlep nox kumtoq tokjilei leq günqnu leq kummeq tingx. Geithibao kum beenyusaq thox gax geithuphi ku tahoungteq kum yanleq pao.<verse eid="MRK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Heix Kohpaq jux Kihpaq</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Matthew 22.15–22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luke 20.20–26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13" />Gapheimaq kummeq pharase ram kokao geithungteq Herod samqsaqram Jesu geto ngaox maq kopüohkopün kappaq thuq ginlhakkax pongx. <verse eid="MRK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14" />Kum kogitoq pei geithungteq, “Nüopa kommeq tingxtao, naq koyingx günqpaq khüonyak. Khüonyakram me jam teih gaginlhak kax naq mong mant thangx. Chamleixma thiba kotok meiyuram ginlhakkax nang nge mong mant koh, geithibao nang nge koyingxpaq Younggan lüm nüoqtao. Komx to sugünq tux Roman angampaq to heix koh a thuq komx ngaoxhung hashao ü jea? Kuto hakoh a ji koh a?” leq kih.<verse eid="MRK 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15" />Geithibabix Jesu weq kum honx tingx geithungteq, “Chemleimathebaq nümxmeq kaq to tongannuq? ka a tunq ngunq jaq lahleq peiketux geithungteq koi yeq tuxleq gannaox” leq lox.<verse eid="MRK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16" />Kum meq lahleq pei geithungteq kuweq kum to henx, “Agamaq ao lhax geithungteq ao münx titao?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:16">“Angampaq leq” kum meq lox.<verse eid="MRK 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17" />Geithuphi Jesu weq, “Geithibanox champopogi Angampaq ginlhak gaga Angampaq a koh unx, geithungteq champopogi Younggan ginlhak gaga Younggan naq koh unx” leq günq.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:17">Geithuphi kum kotoq meilangleq khampungxlop.<verse eid="MRK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Rix ü manneq Gangleq Leihpaq jux Kihpaq</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Matthew 22.23–33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luke 20.27–40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12.18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 23:8">Lümp 23.8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Sadducees ram kokao Jesu geto pei rix ü manneq khüonyak gangleq mant leihleq günqpaq ram kum lhangnguq. <verse eid="MRK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19" />Kummeq günq “Nüopa, komx ginlhakkax Mosa e agapaq ngaoxhung gox, ‘ku sanyuq tahoungteq khüonyak jaq rix geithibao kosaq mopuh e tah gaga thaxnyuq konao e lah ao, geithuphi rixpaq ginlhakkax kosaq a lhangngaox.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20" />Ginlhak jaqmaq ko jei ko nao ram ananthle tei jeilhong peiq e sanyuq lah naosaq mopuh e rix. <verse eid="MRK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21" />Gapheimaq anyixyu pei ye gaga thanyuq lah geithibao naosaq hatix e Rix, aram mupaq naohenneq bix gagawox lah geithibao ga jaunx nox tei; <verse eid="MRK 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22" />Geithungteq, ko jeiqnaoram ananth rappoiq ye mihnyunya gax jaq lah, rappo waq naosaq hati ye Rixlebak. Koka a thaxnyu nyabix rix. <verse eid="MRK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23" />Aleq, gangleq leihpaq nyih rixpaq ram rap leq gangleq leih ao ngeih leq, gaga nya ao sanyuq waq leih yax? Chamleima thiba kum ananth rap poi yeq ku lahphei” leq kummeq günq.<verse eid="MRK 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24" />Jesu weq kum to, “Nümxmeq aogonx pün nu gaga! geithungteq chemleimaq gaga nümxmeq tingxya? aga chemleimaq thibanox nümxmeq laingaox galeq halhangba Younggan gongx mant tingx. <verse eid="MRK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25" />Chamleima thibaq mojuxmaq rixyu manneq gangleq leih ü ngeihleq, kum angkhüo monxtanx param manneq galeq jong ngaox, geithungteq saqlahnyuqlamq mant tiyaox. <verse eid="MRK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26" />Geithibabix rixpaqram gangleq leih a thuq jux: Mosa laiq maq günqyanxtam jux nümx meq mant iexjea? Chamleixma thiba agamaq aga unxneq gox Younggan neq Mosa to günq, ‘Ka Abraham Younggan, Issac Younggan geithungteq Jacob Younggan.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27" />Ku nox rixpaqram Younggan mantlhangq, geithibabix agangram Younggan. Nümxmeq meilang pünleqtitao!” leq günq.<verse eid="MRK 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sibohpaq Ngaoxhung</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:34-40">Matthew 22.34–40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luke 10.25–28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12.28–34 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luk 10.25–28</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ngaoxhung nüopa jaq pei geithungteq kum jaqjaq phi gingpaq tanx. Sadducees ramto Jesuweq jamei yeq lox paq ku weq ngant, geithuphi ku peileq aga unxneq, rappoq beemaoq: “Jampopoge ngaoxhung kopongngax se lhangnguq?” leq kih.<verse eid="MRK 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29" />Jesu weq, “A gapaq meilangleq kopong, ‘Israel ram, tanxlah! Taihungpaq kim Younggan jaq galeq Taihungpaq.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.29 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">kim Younggan jaq galeq Taihungpaq; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">geihalhangba </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Taihungpaq gax kim younggan, ku gax Taihungpaq.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30" />Geithungteq Taihungpaq naq Younggan to mongkha rappeq, geithungteq Lhasaq rappeq, geithungteq naq juteih rappoiq ye geithungteq naq gongx rappoiq ye lung lah.’ <verse eid="MRK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31" />Anyixyupaq ngaoxhung aga, ‘Nangqngeq naq tamxgeqto mamax toqwenneq lung lah.’ Aganyix phi sebohpaq ngaoxhung amungq manttingeih” leq lox.<verse eid="MRK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32" />Ngaoxhung nüopa yeq Jesu to, “shaotaoq Taihungpaq! nangq nge günq nyux jaq unxne Taihungpaq jaq gale Younggan geithungteq ko tokto amungq Younggan mant tei aganox koyingx. <verse eid="MRK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33" />Geithuphix khüonyakkeq ku mongkha rappoiq ye ku tingxlelahpaq ko gongx rappeq Younggan to lung ngaox geithungteq kuweq mamax tamxgeqto kuto wenneq lung lah. Amungq rünmok lahleq peileq Younggan to shomxmuq khünxtonoq aga nyix ngaoxhung tamxpaq semei” leq günq.<verse eid="MRK 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34" />Ku weq tingxleq loxpaq Jesu weq tingxngax zok, geithungteq ku weq kotoq, “Younggan angchingq phix naq panga kooleq mantteix” leq günq.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:34">Gapheimaq aoweq bix Jesu to ngaox henxnaq mong nge halhom.<verse eid="MRK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Messiah jux Kihpaq?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Matthew 22.41–46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luke 20.41–44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35" />Geithibao mojuxmaq Shomxkamp maq Jesu weq honxnüoq leq teix, ku to, “Ngaoxhung nüoparam meq Messiah nox David kosaq ngeihleq beiqyenneq günq nyux? <verse eid="MRK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36" />Koyaoq lhaxsa e David goix paoxleq aleq günq,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">“ ‘Taihungpaq e ka Taihungpaq to günq,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:36">koi yeq naq garam naq lhaq phang maq motham mothamleq</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MRK 12:36">Kar lhakmei lheiqmaq jongtah.’<verse eid="MRK 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37" />Davidteq kolailaitoq ‘Taihungpaq’ leq nyark geithibanox beiqyenneq Messiah David kosaq a lheixyax?” leq günq.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="MRK 12:37">Ngaoxhung Nüoparam to Jesu weq Ngaoxkax Koh</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 12:37">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Matthew 23.1–36</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-47">Luke 20.45–47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:37">Beenyusaq e Jesu ngaox henx meiqleq tanx. <verse eid="MRK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38" />Ku weq nüo juxmaq aga unxneq, “Ngaoxhung nüopa ram aopangngeq pümlob lüoq gunxleq kamq geithungteq chingq yangx maq kum to ojisho pato lung, <verse eid="MRK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39" />Ao weq beeheih Kamp maq aorayx Kamp maq janxjongx komei to lung, kum ginlhakkax küntinglah. <verse eid="MRK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40" />Kum meq thaxnyuq ram to meilangleq roonyai geithungteq kum Kamp to pei, gapheimaq ko tokka hox waqthu ginlhakkax lüoqleq angphung! kum ginlhakkax thangxshih kohpaq segentnuq paq a lhangngaox!” leq günq.<verse eid="MRK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Thaxnyuq Nya e Shomxjito Paq</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 21:1-4">Luke 21.1–4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41" />Jesu Shomxkamp ngunq haixpaq gum jen maq, beenyusaq e ngunq beiqyenneq koh taoleq tuxleq jong. Lungngangq ram meq ngunq meilangleq kohleq tahpaq ngant; <verse eid="MRK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42" />Gapheimaq taishih thaxnyuq nya jaq pei geithungteq kuweq khapsanq phaxkhaq anyixleq koh. <verse eid="MRK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43" />Ku weq Samqsaqram goih e nyark geithungteq kum to, “Koyingx maq koi yeq nümx to günqnu ngeih ngunq koh paq lungmaq aga taishih thaxnyuq nya e rappoq phi seloiqleq kohoungqtao. <verse eid="MRK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44" />Chemleimathibaq amungq rammeq kummaq tipaq mao lahleq jaxpaq galeq pha, geithibabix aga taishih thaxnyuq nya e komaq aogonx tei gaga rapleq phaoungtao” leq günq.<verse eid="MRK 12:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13" />
  <para style="s">Jesu weq Shomxkamp Hopjihum mathuq jux Günq</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Matthew 24.1–2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5">Luke 21.5</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 21:6">6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1" />Shomxkamp tahoungteq Jesu ngaiq juxmaq, ko samqsaqram beemaoq jeiq yeq kotoq, “Nüopaq Tuxwen! Aogonxleq khampungxlop phang longq geithungteq longqkamp nyungeih!” leq günq.<verse eid="MRK 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2" />Jesu weq, “Nangqngeq aga kampnyuq koboh nganttonye? aga mao longq jayaobix jajaphi heihleq mant jong ngaox, kum rap toi leq bakkao” leq lox.<verse eid="MRK 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Thangxpaq ji Phünpheix yathu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Matthew 24.3–14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luke 21.7–19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3" />Shomxkamp phi toring leq tuxleq Olive kahtoq maq Jesu jongleq tijuxmaq Peter, James, John geithungteq Andrew kogitoq pei geithungteq ronxleq kih. <verse eid="MRK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4" />Kum meq, “Aga mojuxmaq ngai aq geithungteq gaga rappoq ngai thaomaq halakhaleq beiqyenneq tiya komx to günpha” leq günq.<verse eid="MRK 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5" />Jesu weq kum to, “Tuxleq jong lah, geithungteq aoweqbix nümx to nga a tha kohlah. <verse eid="MRK 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6" />Khüonyak meilangleq ka münx maq pei keox geithungteq günqnaox ‘Ka nox ku-ngeih!’ geithuphi khüonyak meilangleq nga a koh aox. <verse eid="MRK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7" />Mojux maq nümxmeq gaanrüthpa ngaoxging geithungteq gaanrüthpa mogünx tanxnaox ngeihleq, nümx mong tha thangx. Gaphangx ngaiyao kopong, geithibao gaphangx leimaq koka ngoiyathu mantlhangq. <verse eid="MRK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8" />Chamleima thibaq jat jeiqyeq jat jaq phix, angchingq jeiqyeq angchingq jaq phix toktei leq rüthtaox. Peqchih hex yu pangyungx lungmaq tiyaox geithungteq nonxnyuq nüowaox. Ganox lhamqshick kak koke gangnguq jaagaqngeih.<verse eid="MRK 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13.9–11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:17-20">Mat 10.17–20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:11">Luk 12.11</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 12:12">12</ref></char>
    </note>“Geithibao nümx meq mamax ginlhakkax küntinglah. Naq lüoqleq khaqwaox geithungteq anggochan maq lahleq peiyaox. Nümx to beeheih Kamp maq phet tao; nümx eikhung ram ji angam ram muhthaoq maq kum to gaanrangx komei günnathuq ginlhakkax geithungteq ka ginlhakkax yongqngaox. <verse eid="MRK 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10" />Geithungteq agangnga jat raptoq gaanrangx komei nüowaox. <verse eid="MRK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11" />Mojuxmaq nümx lüoqwaoqngeih geithungteq anggochan to paoxwaoxngeih, nümx me cham lox angeihleq ginlhak mongoi ye mong tha thangx; Gajuxmaq nümx to chemphang pha a ngeihle gaga günnan. Chamleima thibaq nümx me gingpaq nox nümx mantlhangq, lhasaq koyaoq manneq peikeox. <verse eid="MRK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12" />Khüonyak ram me mamax jei ji naoq jaqjaq tangqleq rixya koh aox, geithungteq ko paq ram meq mamax saqram phe kenxnaox, kosaq ram meq mamax paq ji nyu phe kenxngaileq kumtoq rixya koh aox. <verse eid="MRK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:22">Mat 10.22</ref></char></note>Ka leimaq khüonyakram rappeq nümx to nyuxkeox. Geithebaoq aopangngeq koka to ngoi ye shum maq zok gaga ram meq agang tak kaox.<verse eid="MRK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Khampungxlop pu Kogenq jux</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-28">Matthew 24.15–28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luke 21.20–24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14" />“Mojuxmaq nümx meq ngant ‘Nyurik ku Kogenq’ gaga ku hayongq khathu lungmaq yongle ngant.” (Jam to lebpu iex param me tingnganx) “Gajux maq aopangq Judea maq tei kahtoq lheiq to paowenx. <verse eid="MRK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.15,16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 17:31">Luk 17.31</ref></char></note>Kamp tok maq ao jongleq shao Kamp khayuh monx lah a leih a ginlhak thajak. <verse eid="MRK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16" />Geithungteq kah maq ao teleshao khuq lah a Kamp maq tha leih. <verse eid="MRK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17" />Gapaq nyih ginlhak maq ao mihnyu naogomqleq ao bangx geithungteq Naosaq ram meq nyuh shup juxmaq tei, kum ginlhakkax ayuxwao! <verse eid="MRK 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18" />Aga phang goxnyu ginlhak maq ha ngai athu ginlhakkax Younggan to angphunglah! <verse eid="MRK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 7:14">Ngai 7.14</ref></char></note>Chamleima thibaq gaga nyih maq ngaipa thangxpaq nox Younggan neq kahganyuq ringq paq nyih manneq jenyih to ngoi ye thangx paq phe segentqleq tiyaox. Gale halhangba gagaunneq tipaq nyih ji ginlhak jam mant tiyaox. <verse eid="MRK 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20" />Geithibabix gapaq nyih tohleq phawungtao; kuweq gagaunneq haringq banox, aobix mantgang zokkaox. Geithibabix kuweq rünqleq ngaix phei khüonyakram, to gapaq nyih toh a phaoungtao.<verse eid="MRK 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21" />“Geithibanox khüonyak kokao weq natoq, ‘Tuxwen aga maq Messiah’ halhangba ‘Tuxwen agamaq ku!’ leq ganbanox gato koyingx thateih. <verse eid="MRK 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22" />Chamleima thibaq ngaoxlab Messiah ram geithungteq ngaoxlab Ashiram ngaiyao. Konongx lheiqkao to goix a thuq ginlhakkax kum me halakhaleq ji kahhonxangmanx hoxwaox. <verse eid="MRK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23" />Geithibabix nümx küntingleq jonglah ginlhakpei thaomaq koi yeq nümx to rap günpheingeih.<verse eid="MRK 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Khüonyak Kosaq Peipa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Matthew 24.29–31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luke 21.25–28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13.24 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="REV 6:12">Ngai 6.12</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Gajuxmaq thangxpaq gaphangx nyih lenxleq leqpheimaq angtan nyak kaox, lenxnyuq mant pho waox, <verse eid="MRK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 6:13">Ngai 6.13</ref></char></note>Ang mao lenxsaq ram yawaox, geithungteq angba mao gongx tipaq ram nyun nao. <verse eid="MRK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 1:7">Ngai 1.7</ref></char></note>Gapheimaq khüonyak kosaq ngaix yaox, Angphom mao gongx koboh phe geithungteq miktuxthantamei yuq phi yuxpaq kummeq ngantnaox. <verse eid="MRK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27" />Gajux maq kuweq angkhüo monxtanx param konuk begix woto pongxngaox, geithungteq Youngganneq rünq param kahgannyuq konuk begix jalheiq nuk ma e jalheiq nuk ka pei ye leq haih ji heihuox.<verse eid="MRK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Phokpün maq Tingxleq Lahathu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Matthew 24.32–35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luke 21.29–33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28" />“Phokpün maq lepleq honxnüoqpaq nümxmeq tingxya. Mojuxmaq kokangq kosongq ngaix geithungteq kolhak ringngax leq gang chuxnyuq shohtataoleq nümxmeq tingx, <verse eid="MRK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29" />Gaga jaunneq mojux maq nümx meq gaphangx ngaipa ngant nawngeihleq ginlhak shohtatoq gaga lungkax jong maq tetaoleq tingxlah.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.29 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ginlhak shohtatoq gaga lungkax jong maq tetaoleq tingxlah; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">geihalhangba </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">ku pei a shoh taga.</char></note> <verse eid="MRK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30" />Koi yeq koyingxmaq nümx to günq nungeih, gaphangx rappuq ngai leq mobak mobak leq gayinx lenxleq mant leqyaox. <verse eid="MRK 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31" />Angkhüo ji kahgan lenxleq paoxwaox, geithibaoq ka ngaox lenxleq mant leqyao.”<verse eid="MRK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nyih ji Ginlhak Aoweqbix Manttingx</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:36-44">Matthew 24.36–44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13.32 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 24:36">Mat 24.36</ref>
      </char>
    </note> “Gapaq nyih geihalhangba tantux, mo e peiyaoxngeih, angkhüo monxtanx param meq bix galehalhangba kosaq e yaoxbix, mant tingngaox. Geithibabix ko paq yeq ga tingtao. <verse eid="MRK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33" />Küntinglah mongganglah, chemleimathibaq ginlhak mo we peiyaox ngeih leq nümx meq mant tingx. <verse eid="MRK 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:36-38">Luk 12.36–38</ref></char></note>Aganox ko Kamp monxthao rap ko thaotho param to noxleix kohleq tah, lungka teiqpaq to tux ji teiqyen leq günqleq tahoungteq günqlüoq to pao paq khüonyak jaq letao. <verse eid="MRK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35" />Geithuyao we küntinglah, chamleixma thibaq Kamp popaq mo weq peiyaoxngeih yanying geihalhangba gunttanx maq geihalhangba Aokanx juxmaq geihalhangba homxmaq nümx meq manttingx. <verse eid="MRK 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36" />Ku günbathmaq pei thaoq maq naq nguh leq hajongngathu ginlhakkax küntinglah. <verse eid="MRK 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37" />Koiyeq jam nümx to günq, koiyeq nümx rap to günq nungeih tux ji tanq leq jonglah!” leq günq.<verse eid="MRK 13:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14" />
  <para style="s">Jesu Langxngax Shingxpaq</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Matthew 26.1–5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1">Luke 22.1</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">John 11.45–53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1" />Aleq khoihleqtahpaq aorayx je phushum hamoix paq An aorayx nyih anyi thaomaq ngungxpaq eikhung ram geithungteq ngaoxhung nüoparam meq ronxleq Jesu lüoqwaq geithungteq langxngaxleq lüm. <verse eid="MRK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2" />Kum meq, “Aganox aorayx juxmaq thamokkhah, Chemleimathibaq khüonyakram mobkulah lhangga,” leq ging.<verse eid="MRK 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bethany maq Jesu to Nganxjie Popa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Matthew 26.6–13</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">John 12.1–8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14.3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 7:37">Luk 7.37</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 7:38">38</ref></char>
    </note>Mojuxmaq Bethany mao angonpaq Simon Kamp maq Jesu günqpaq a ngoix leq teix, mojuxmaq ku shahleq teix mihnyu nya jai yeq jagonx thoqrahpaq nganxjie powathuq alabaster thungq jaq phix pei. Mihnyu nya e nganxjie thungq hop geithungteq Jesu khüo to phux. <verse eid="MRK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4" />Geithibao gama tiü khüonyakram kokao mongkhah ngaix, geithungteq agaunneq jajaphix ging, “Aga nganxjie thokleq jark koi yeq cham ngai yax? <verse eid="MRK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5" />Aga nox tunq phaxkhaq<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.5 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">tunq phaxkhaq: </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 6:37">6.37</ref></char> maq tuxwen.</note> gokbanx aram phix nyeiqpaq to tangnguphangx, geithungteq gaga ngunq taishih ram to kohphangx lhangnguq!” leq günq. Geithuphi ku toq kum meq hameipaq ngaox günq.<verse eid="MRK 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6" />Geithibao Jesu weq, “Ganya koja tah unx chamleixmaq nümx ko ginlhakkax mong thangxnguq? Gaga nya e ka ginlhakkax meilang meipaq monx ringqngungqtao. <verse eid="MRK 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7" />Taishih khüonyakram nümx phi gaxlomaq tekeox, geithuphix nümx mojuxmaq taoh a tux, kum to taoh unx. Geithibabix ka nümx phix gaxlomaq mant tiyaox. <verse eid="MRK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8" />Aga nya e chempopogi zok gaga ku weq gax ringqngungqtao; guewathu ginlhak pei thaomaqle aga nya e ka pümx to nganxjie phe puo. <verse eid="MRK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9" />Koyingxmaq koi yeq nümx to günnyuxngeih! Kahgan rappoq lheiqkao maq Gaanrangx komei ayungmaq nüo mihnyu nya e chemring gaga teihtakleq gax ngaox günkeo” leq günq.<verse eid="MRK 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Tangqngaxleq Judas e Mongjam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Matthew 26.14–16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luke 22.3–6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10" />Gapheimaq Judas Iscariot Samqsaqram banxbaanyix bemaoq jaq ngungxpaq eikhung ram lhakmaq Jesu tangqleq koh a leq paox. <verse eid="MRK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11" />Ku weq cham günqleq kum rap mongmeileq tanx, geithungteq ku to ngunq koh athuq ginlhakkax kahjoq. Gapheimaq Jesu yanxleq koh a thuq ginlhak kax Judas e kolümx lümq.<verse eid="MRK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ko Samqsaqram phix Jesu weq Khoihleq Tahpaq Aorayx Shah.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Matthew 26.17–25</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-14">Luke 22.7–14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:23">21.23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">John 13.21–30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12" />Phushum hamoix paq An aorayx agangpaq nyih khoihleq tahpaq aorayx ginlhakkax nirsaq langxpaq nyih ku samqsaqram me Jesu to, “A yungx maq paoxleq komx meq naq ginlhakkax khoihleq tahpaq Aorayx shingx ngathuq?” leq kih.<verse eid="MRK 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13" />Gapheimaq Jesu weq ku shamqsaqram bemao anyix gapaq ngaox phix pongx, “Chingqnyuq to zongqngant, jie chick küntleq khüonyak jaq nümx phi pong keox kophaito goixyenx. <verse eid="MRK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14" />Kopheito goixleq ku zongqpaq Kamp to nyappün, geithungteq Kamp popa to aleq günqnanx! ‘Nüopa e aleq günq, ka geithungteq ka samqsaqram komx meq khoihleq tahpaq aorayx ayungx lung maq shah a thuq?’ <verse eid="MRK 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15" />Ku weq kohgah to nyoiq koboh jaq got konxleq thampaq hox phakeox, gama nümx meq kim ginlhakkax shingxnganx” günq leq ponx.<verse eid="MRK 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16" />Samqsaqram lhaqyongqleq Chingqnyuq to zongq geithuphix Jesu weq kum to günqnu yaoyaoleq panggeq tak geithungteq kum meq gamaq khoih leq tahpaq aorayx shah a leix maq shingx.<verse eid="MRK 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17" />Mojux maq günxngoi, Samqsaqram banxbaanyix phix Jesu pei. <verse eid="MRK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18" />Mojuxmaq kum tabkhung maq ngeihleq jongleq shah, Jesu weq günq, “Koi koyingx maq günqnu ngeih! ka phi shahleq tipaq nümx betanx mao jeiq yeq ka yanleq koh ao” leq günq.<verse eid="MRK 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19" />Samsaram meilangleq mongpüok geithungteq jaq phei ma jaq leq kum meq koh to, “koyingx maq nangqngeq ka to günqnu jea?” leq kih.<verse eid="MRK 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20" />Jesu weq, “Nümx banxbaanyix mao jaq ao weq ka phe khung ja maq shah ü ngeih. <verse eid="MRK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21" />Khüonyak Kosaq nox laiq ngaox maq beiqunneq günq gaga unxneq rixyaox; geithibabix aoweq khüonyak kosaq tangqleq koh u ngeih ko ginlhakkax aogonxleq genqnangenye? Gapaq khüonyak ginlhakkaxnox ku puhyaox hapuhpa simeileq tishe lhangnguq!” leq lox.<verse eid="MRK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Taihungpaq Yaning Tamq</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Matthew 26.26–30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luke 22.14–20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Korinth 11.23–25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22" />Mojuxmaq kum shah ü ngeihleq Jesu weq An lah münxboh kohleq angphung pakleq khih, geithungteq samqsaqram to koh leq, “Aga lah unx, aganox ka pümx” leq günq.<verse eid="MRK 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23" />Gapheimaq ku weq ruh lah Younggan to münxboh koh, geithungteq kum to koh; geithungteq kum rappo yeq gaga mao ying. <verse eid="MRK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24" />Jesu weq, “Aganox ka agie champopogi yeq khüonyak meilang ginlhakkax yin, geithungteq Younggan phix kahjoxyonggüt. <verse eid="MRK 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25" />Koyingx maq koi yeq nümx to gün nu ngeih, agapaq nyih maq Younggan angchingq maq koi yeq korünqnax moying moyingleq koi yeq gureak jie aleq manneq mant ying ngaox” leq günq.<verse eid="MRK 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26" />Gaman phaimaq kum meq taix jaq garkkungteq Olive kahtoq to paox.<verse eid="MRK 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Peter e Halox athu Jesu weq Thatpa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Matthew 26.31–35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luke 22.31–34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">John 13.36–38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27" />Geithungteq Jesu weq kum to, “Nümx rappoiyeq ka tahoungteq yanleq paoxwaox, chemleimathibaq laingaox e günq tao, ‘Youngganneq nir teipaq langxngaox, phettaox geithuphi nir ji nirteiqparam lhükleq paowaox’ <verse eid="MRK 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 28:16">Mat 28.16</ref></char></note>Geithibao ka gangleq leih phei maq nümx muhthaoq maq Galilee to ka paoxleq peiyaox” leq günq.<verse eid="MRK 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29" />Peter e, “Amungq ram rappoiq ye tah babix koi yeq Naq mojux mabix mant tah!” leq lox.<verse eid="MRK 14:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30" />Jesu weq Peter to, “Koyingx maq koi yeq naq to gün nu ngeih, chi günt aopong kanx anyixmaq mokax mongmaq nangq nge ka manttingx leq aram maq lox waox” leq günq.<verse eid="MRK 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31" />Peter e segongq le, “Ka naq phe rixya lhang babe koi yeq naq manttingx leq mojux mabix mant loxwaox” leq lox.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:31">Geithungteq amung Samsaram rappo yeq bix jaunneq günq.<verse eid="MRK 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu weq Gethsemane Pangunt maq Angphung</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Matthew 26.36–46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luke 22.39–46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32" />Kum Gethsemaneleq nyarkpaq lung to ngoi, geithuphe Jesu weq samqsaqram to, “Koi yeq angphung juxmaq amaq jongkeiq” leq günq. <verse eid="MRK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33" />Gapheimaq ku weq peter ji James, John goix paox, mongthang monggenq nyux rueleq kugah maq pei. <verse eid="MRK 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34" />Geithungteq ku weq kum to, “Ka mongkha mao monggüntleq rixyathuq panga nyeigai tatao, gage yeq ka to hah athuq lhangga. Ama jongkei geithungteq mongganglah” leq günq.<verse eid="MRK 14:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35" />Ku sisa kooleq raq, kolhungxlhungxka phalenyox yuh lhaqkuh shongqleq bum, geithungteq aga unxneq angphung, zokbanox agapaq ginlhak ku manneq lahleq paoxpha. <verse eid="MRK 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36" />Geithungteq kuweq, “Abba, Ohpaq, Naq ginlhakkax hazokkaqthuq jaq jagee mant teix. Aga ruh ka manneq lahleq paoxpha geithibabex koi yeq lungnguq wenneq mantlhangq geithebaoq naq khungkhungx” leq günq.<verse eid="MRK 14:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37" />Gapheimaq ku nongleq leih geithuphi Samqsaqram aram muq nguh leq bangx, geithuphix Peter to, “Simon, naq nguhganye? Tantux jayaobiq nümx gangleq jong mant zokjea?” leq günq. <verse eid="MRK 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38" />Geithuphe ku weq kum to, “Nümx kotueh maq haya athuq ginlhakkax, mong ganglah, geithungteq angphunglah, lhasaq e no lungpaq geithibabix meixpüm maq gongx mantteix” leq günq.<verse eid="MRK 14:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39" />Ku chambix paox, geithungteq gapaq ngaox jaq unxneq angphung, <verse eid="MRK 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40" />Gapheimaq ku samqsaqram geka nongxleq leih geithuphix kum meq mik zabpa hazok geithuphix kutoq cham kah leih a ngeihleq kum meq hatingx.<verse eid="MRK 14:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41" />Mojux maq ku aram maq nongxleq leih, ku weq kum to, “Nümx nguh lo leq noxrak meiqleq jongnguqnye? Atanox gangtah ginlhak ngoi taga! tuxlah, aleq khüonyak kosaq konyux ram lhakmaq koh aox. <verse eid="MRK 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42" />Rüo wenx kim paoxkhah tuxwen ka laoq wa thupaq agamatiga” leq günq.<verse eid="MRK 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu lüoqpaq</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Matthew 26.47–56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luke 22.47–53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">John 18.3–12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43" />Ku harakkeq gingleq tijux maq Samqsaqram banxbaanyixyu beemaoq jaq Judas e goixleq ngungxpaq angshamram ngaoxhung nüoparam geithungteq nyakmei rammeq pongxpaq beenyusaq lhangqlaoq ji püntamq phi pei. <verse eid="MRK 14:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44" />Lüopaq e beenyu to hapünna thuq jaq hox, “Aoto koi yeq lhub paox ngeih leq nümx meq lümq paq ku galhang ngaox ngeih nümx meq ku laoqwenx geithungteq teiqleq goix leq paoxlah” leq günq.<verse eid="MRK 14:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45" />Judas peileq ngoi yuq phi jampmeq ku Jesu gekara geithungteq, “Nüopa!” leq günq nungteq kotoq lhub. <verse eid="MRK 14:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46" />Gapheimaq kum meq Jesu to tamx geithungteq khax. <verse eid="MRK 14:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47" />Geithibao youngleq teparam bemaoq jeiq yeq ko lhangqlaoq sheatleq lah eikhung ngungxpaq zaa naxkhuh shüokleq jark. <verse eid="MRK 14:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48" />Gapheimaq Jesu weq ngaox ngaix, geithungteq kum to, “Ka lüoqwaq thuq ginlhakkax akuhpaq jaq unxneq nümx lhangqlüoq ji püntamq phi peiyu nye? <verse eid="MRK 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.49 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 19:47">Luk 19.47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:37">21.37</ref></char></note>Nganyih nganyih leq ka nümx phix shomxkamp maq honxnüoqleq jong geithibao nümx meq ka halüo. Geithibabix laingaox koyingx maq ngai yaox kopong” leq günq.<verse eid="MRK 14:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50" />Gapheimaq Samqsaqram rappoiyeq ku tahoungteq paox.<verse eid="MRK 14:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51" />Naohan jaleq komongka gunxpaq khuqsaq jaq gunxleq Jesu pheito goix. Kum meq ku laoq wa gongx, <verse eid="MRK 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52" />Geithibabix, ku khuq gaq tah oungteq ku pümx kungx maq phatleq paox.<verse eid="MRK 14:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Heixteiqram Mohthao maq Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57-68">Matthew 26.57–68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54">Luke 22.54</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:55">55</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63–71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13">John 18.13</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:14">14</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19–24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53" />Gapheimaq kum meq Aokhong ngungxpaq Kamp to Jesu goixleq pei, ayungx maq ngungxpaq Angshamramq nyakmeiram geithungteq ngaoxhung Nüoparam goih peiq. <verse eid="MRK 14:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54" />Toxtox kax Peter bix goix, geithuphi Aokhong ngungxpaq langmuephang ngoi yeq leq pei. Gama gaantux param phix ku bix günlamq güoleq jong. <verse eid="MRK 14:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55" />Ngungxpaq eikhungram geithungteq council rappoiyeq Jesu weq mokpaq maq paoh ji pünpa jaq tibanox ku langxngathuq thatma lümq, geithebaoq kum meq jajage hatak. <verse eid="MRK 14:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56" />Khüonyak meilang nge alab saqkiq koh geithibabix kum ngaox phi jaq jagee hashao.<verse eid="MRK 14:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57" />Gapheimaq khüonyak kokao yong, geithungteq Jesu phi tokteiq leq agapaq ngaoxlab saqkiq günq, <verse eid="MRK 14:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.58 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 2:19">Jhn 2.19</ref></char></note> “Ku weq aga unxneq günqpaq kom meq tanx, khüonyak lhak ke ringqpaq gapaq Shomxkamp koi yeq pünnaox geithungteq nyih aram mongmaq lhak ke haringpaq amungjaq koi yeq ringqngaox ” leq günq. <verse eid="MRK 14:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59" />Geithibabix kummeq günqpaq saqkiq to mongjam mant teix.<verse eid="MRK 14:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60" />Gajuxmaq Aokhong ngungxpaq kum rappoq muhthaoq mayongq geithungteq Jesu to, “Naq phi tokjitei leq ngaox peipaq ram to nangq nge jajageq mant loxjeaq?” leq kih.<verse eid="MRK 14:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61" />Geithibao Jesu ngaox pha jaq yaox bix halox weq zangyo leq jong. Aokhong ngungxpaq e anyix maq, “Thaomeipaq Younggan kosaq Messiah Naq jea?” leq kih.<verse eid="MRK 14:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62" />Jesu weq, “Ku nox kangeih, geithuphi khüonyak kosaq ko ngan gongx tiü paq lhakmei lheiqmaq jongleq Angphom phi yu paq nümx rappoiyeq ngantnaox” leq günq.<verse eid="MRK 14:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63" />Gajuxmaq Aokhong ngungxpaq e ku khuq shinx geithungteq, “Aphe sheloileq kim meq amungq saqkiq aomaq mant pei. <verse eid="MRK 14:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64" />Ku weq Younggan to paohjipünpaq ngaox nümx meq tanxpheishih nümx meq beiqunneq günqnaq?” leq günq.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:64">Kum rappoiyeq günq mantshao ji mantshao geithuphi ku langxkohleq ngaoxyonx.<verse eid="MRK 14:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65" />Kokao weq kotoq chuhon thonxna gang geithungteq ku mik to khuq phix lummungqteq ku to tab. Kum meq, “Aoweq tappo sogüntue” leq günq. Geithungteq gantuxram meq ku lah geithungteq phet.<verse eid="MRK 14:65" /></para>
  <para style="s">Peter e Jesu Zarkq</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">Matthew 26.69–75</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luke 22.56–62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">John 18.15–18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25–27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66" />Peter langmue phang maq jongleq tei gajuxmaq Eikhung ngungxpaq thaothoq nyu jaq pei. <verse eid="MRK 14:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67" />Geithungteq gaga nya e peter günqlümx güoleq tipaq ngant, gaga nya e peter to yungyakleq tux geithungteq, “Naqbix Nazarene maoq Jesu phe jong paq” leq günq.<verse eid="MRK 14:67" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68" />Geithibao ku weq mantlhang, “Koi yeq manttingx nangqngeq cham günqnu leq koiyeq manttingx” leq keaq. Geithuphi ku Kamp thaoyuh yux gaphi goih e aopong kawaox.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.68 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kokao lhakgoxlaiq maq </char><char style="fq" closed="false">gaphi goih e aopong kawaox, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">le mant teix.</char></note><verse eid="MRK 14:68" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69" />Thaothoq nyu harakkeq ku ngant geithungteq yong leq tiparam to, “Aga khüonyakpaq bix kum beemaoq jaqngeih” leq günq. <verse eid="MRK 14:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70" />Geithibao Peter e anyix maq zarkq.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 14:70">Langq ji jong pheimaq, gamaq yong leq tiparam meq peter to naq bix lhang nguq ngeih leq chambix kih, “Koyingx maq Naq egaram phux mantlhang ngeihleq tha günq, chamleixma thiba naq bix Galilee mao” leq kum meq günq.<verse eid="MRK 14:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71" />Geithibao Peter e galeq, “Koi yeq koyingx günqnyuxq halhang banox Younggan neq ka to komox napha lah! Nümx meq günq paq khüonyak jux koi yeq mant tingx” leq keaq.<verse eid="MRK 14:71" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72" />Gaphi goih e aopong anyix maq kapaq tanx, geithuphix Jesu weq kotoq beiqunneq günq peter e teihtak “Aopongq anyix maq kaa thao maq nangq nge aram maq ka manttingxleq keaqyao” geithuphi gaga teihtakleq ku khaklak leq hap.<verse eid="MRK 14:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15" />
  <para style="s">Pilate thaomaq Jesu Lahleq Peix</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1">Matthew 27.1</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:2">2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11–14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luke 23.1–5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">John 18.28–38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1" />Nüpnyingq homxmaq Eikhung ngungxpaq meilang mamleq nyakmeiram phix, ngaoxhung nüoparam phix, geithungteq Heixteixram rap phix pong, geithungteq kum meq singxjimingx. Kum meq Jesu to yangue phix khax, geithungteq goix leq peileq Pilate ta koh. <verse eid="MRK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2" />Geithuphi pilate teq kotoq, “Naq Jehudiram angngampaqjea?” leq kih.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:2">Jesu weq, “Nangq nge galeq günqpaq shaotaoq” leq lox.<verse eid="MRK 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3" />Aokhong ngungxpa e Jesu to pang ge maq püohjipünpa tonlamq. <verse eid="MRK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4" />Geithuphi Pilate teq ku to chambix, “Nangq nge jajage mant loxnye? tuxwen aogonxleq kum meq nangq nge paoh paq tonlamq leq günqnu” leq kih.<verse eid="MRK 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5" />Geithibao Jesu weq ngaox phajayao halox, geithuphi Pilate meilangleq Khampungxlob.<verse eid="MRK 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Rixya Ngaox Yan</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Matthew 27.15–26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luke 23.13–25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">John 18.39—19.16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6" />Aleq khoihleq tahpaq Aorayx maq tenxkamp maq tiparam beemaoq jaq khüonyak ram meq ao yuwaoxngeih leq Pilate teq zorleq pao wa banlam teix. <verse eid="MRK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7" />Barabbas leq münxpaq khüonyak jaq pümxpanngoxsi mob ngaipa juxmaq khüonyak lalx mang ngaipa leimaq tenxkamp maq thamq. <verse eid="MRK 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8" />Mojux maq beenyusaq heih, gajuxmaq ku weq kum to thaoka ringqngu unxneq ringqphaleq Pilate to yu. <verse eid="MRK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9" />Ku weq kum to, “Koi yeq nümx to Jehudi angampaq zorleq pha a tueya?” ku weq günq. <verse eid="MRK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10" />Kum meq sheixjekhah oh leix maq Ngungxpaq angshamram meq Jesu phünjipha üleq ku weq tingx.<verse eid="MRK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11" />Geithibao Aokhong ngungxpaq ram meq leihleq beenyusaq ram meq Jesu paq halhangnge kum max Barabbas paq zorpha leq günq nanleq khangq. <verse eid="MRK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12" />Beenyusaq to pilateteq chambix, “Geithibanox nümx meq Jehudi angampaq leq nyark pato koi yeq jam ringqngax tuetao” leq günq.<verse eid="MRK 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13" />Kum meq chingqgarkleq, “Ku lakteiqmaq kingxkoh” leq lox.<verse eid="MRK 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14" />Pilate teq kum to, “Geithibanox ku weq kogenq jam ringqphei?” leq kih.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:14">Kum meq segongqleq chingqgarkleq, “Ku lakteiqmaq kingxnganx!” leq günq.<verse eid="MRK 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15" />Pilate teq beenyusaq mong lham maq koh a tue, geithuphix ku weq kum ginlhak kax Barabbas zorleq koh, gapheimaq ku weq Jesu to phetgueq phi phet phaimaq lakteiqmaq kingxngaxleq zanxleq koh.<verse eid="MRK 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Naomeiram meq Jesu to Shaixjiyaix</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:27-31">Matthew 27.27–31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2">John 19.2</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 19:3">3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16" />Naomei ram meq Jesu Angam Kamp to goixleq zanx, geithuphi kum meq amungram rap nyark leq heih. <verse eid="MRK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17" />Kum meq Jesu to natnyu khuq jaq gunxleq koh, tuh kontamq ringqngungteq ku khüomaq kopleq koh. <verse eid="MRK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18" />Gapheimaq kum meq saqlamx koh, “Jehudiram Angampaq yinx lüoqleq shongqlah” leq günq. <verse eid="MRK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19" />Geithungteq kummeq ku khüo to phet, kutoq chuhon phe thonx, geithungteq kum meq lhaqkuh singleq bamleq ku to shomx. <verse eid="MRK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20" />Mojux maq kum meq kutoq yaoxjile ü rünx, kum meq natnyu khuq lah geithungteq ku khuq woleq gunxleq koh. Gapheimaq ku kum meq lakteiq maq kingxngax goixleq paox.<verse eid="MRK 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Lakteiq maq Kingxpaq</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Matthew 27.32–44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luke 23.26–43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">John 19.17–27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15.21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 16:13">Rom 16.13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Cyrene mao Alexander ji Rufus kopaq Simon tox kaq manneq Nokmaq leihpaq kum phi lüm maq pong, geithuphi kum meq kutoq Jesu lakteiq pai yenleq khangq. <verse eid="MRK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22" />Geithuphi kum Jesu Golgotha leq münxpaq lung to (Lebpuq khüogo lung) to goixleq pei. <verse eid="MRK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23" />Gama kum meq ku to gureak yux phi kokhah gon nungteq koh, geithibao Jesu weq haying. <verse eid="MRK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24" />Gapheimaq ku kum meq lakteiq maq kingx geithungteq ku khuq tanx nathuq ginlhakkax aopopoiyeq champopogi lah a leq tingxngathuq ginxlhakka ngaktan. <verse eid="MRK 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25" />Mojux maq ku kum meq lakteiq maq kingx, nüpnyingq tantue akuq wa lhang leq teix. <verse eid="MRK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26" />Kophi tokteileq püohpa leq aga unxneq, “Jehudiram angampaq” leq gox. <verse eid="MRK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27" />Geithungteq kum meq Jesu phi tüoyan paq anyixleq lakteiq maq kingx. Japaq lhakshih kao maq geithungteq amungpaq lhakmei kao maq. <verse eid="MRK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" pubnumber="[28]" sid="MRK 15:28" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kokao lhakgoxlaiq maq lhaakpaq 28 maq baox: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">agaunneq laingaox koyingx nga lhang ngaox leq günqpaq, ku bix khüonyak kogenqram phi nangnguqleq baoxleq, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">goxleq titao (</char><char style="xt"><ref loc="LUK 22:37">Luk 22.37</ref></char> maq ngant naox).</note><verse eid="MRK 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15.29 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 14:58">Mrk 14.58</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:19">Jhn 2.19</ref></char>
    </note>Geithuphi gakaleqpaq khüonyak ram meq kum khüobenq geithungteq Jesu to haileq, “Hehe naq aoweq Shomxkamp pün nungteq nyih aram mong maq ronx naox leq günqpaq, <verse eid="MRK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30" />aleq lakteiq manneq yuxtah geithungteq nalailai gangtah” yao leq günq.<verse eid="MRK 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31" />Gaga jaunneq Aokhong ngungxpaq ram meq ngaoxhung nüoparam meq Jesu to yaoxjile leq ringqleq kum meq, “Ku weq goiq panox gangngax koh geithibabix ku weq ku hagangx zok. <verse eid="MRK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32" />Israel Angampaq Messiah, Aleq lakteiq püntoq manneq leihpaq to tuxkhah, geithuphe kim me ku to koyingxleq teihkhah” leq günq.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:32">Geithuphi kophi lakteiqmaq kingx paq nyix yeq bix kutoq ja unneq yaox.<verse eid="MRK 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Rix paq</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Matthew 27.45–56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luke 23.44–49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">John 19.28–30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33" />Geithuphi tangukgark manneq aram tantue ngoi yeleq kagan nyuq rappo maq angnyak pei. <verse eid="MRK 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34" />Tantue aram ginlhak maq Jesu weq ngaox gongxphe, <char style="tl">“Eloi, Eloi, lema sabachthani?”</char> leq hap. Labpuq, “Ka Younggan, ka Younggan, nangqngeq ka cham maq jark kuq?” leq lhang.<verse eid="MRK 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35" />Gamatipaq khüonyakram kukaoq weq kogingx tanx, geithungteq, “Poqkituxwox, kuweq Elijah to nyarkkulhanggo!” leq ging. <verse eid="MRK 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36" />Kum beetanx mao jeiq yeq yuxshinx, gonx nungteq gamaq khugenq shamx, gaman maq leqlao ro maq khax oungteq ku weq gaga zünx leq Jesu chunka thomx geithungteq, “Sotah koh! Lakteiq mao ku lah leih a Elijah yuxyaq a tux khah!” leq günq.<verse eid="MRK 15:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37" />Geithuphi rangqngurangq hap pungteq Jesu rix.<verse eid="MRK 15:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38" />Shomxkamp maq thongpaq thongkhuq kugah to manneq lhajongyuh peiyeqleq anyixya shark. <verse eid="MRK 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39" />Naomei eikhungpaq ao lakteiq phi tingxkhak yong leq teix, Jesu weq beiqunneq hap pungteq rixleq ngant,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.39 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">hap pungteq rix; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kokao lhakgox laiq maq </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ku rixleq ngant, </char><char style="ft" closed="false">leq titao.</char></note> ku weq, “Aga khüonyak koyingx maq Younggan kosaq lhangga!” leq günq.<verse eid="MRK 15:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15.40–41 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 8:2">Luk 8.2</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 8:3">3</ref></char>
    </note>Gama mihnyuqnya ram kukaoq bix toxkamanneq tux leq jong, Kum nox Magdalene ram Mary, James naokipaq ji Joseph konyuq Mary, geithungteq Salome. <verse eid="MRK 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41" />Mojuxmaq Jesu Galilee gaankamx maq teix, kum kopheitoq goix geithungteq kutoq taohjiphüng, amungq mihnyu nyaram bix meilangleq kophi Jerusalem Chingnyuq to peipaq kum phix nangleq teix.<verse eid="MRK 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Mang Gue paq</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Matthew 27.57–61</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luke 23.50–56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">John 19.38–42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42-43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42-43" />Aganox Sabbath thaomaoq singxpaq nyih alhang, geithungteq mojux maq gunxpongx ngoi, Arimathea chingqnyuq mao Joseph peileq ngoi, ku bix Heixteixram bemaoq eikhungpaq jaq a lhang geithungteq Younggan angchingq pei yathuq to tanxpaq ram beetanxmaoq jaaleq tei; Geithuphe ganyih nox aorayxya singxnguq nyih jaq a lhang geithuyaoxwe mongboh oh phi pilate gito Joseph pei geithungteq kutoq Jesu mang yu. <verse eid="MRK 15:42-43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44" />Jesu atanox rixtataoleq tantleq pilate khampungxlob, ku weq naomei ram to khungpaq nyark geithungteq kih Jesu rix manq maq ginlhak seba phei jea! <verse eid="MRK 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45" />Naomeiram to khungpaq mao ngaox leih pheimaq Pilate teq Joseph to günq mang lahleq paox wa zokkaox. <verse eid="MRK 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46" />Josephpeq khuqnyaixsaq jaq lahleq pei, Mang lahleq leih khuq maq yoit geithungteq longq gütleq ringqpaq manggom maq thamq. Gapheimaq kuweq longqkhaoq kobohnyu jeiq yeq manggom khaq to khub. <verse eid="MRK 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47" />Magdalene ram Mary ji Joseph konyuq Mary ram meq tux leq jong, geithuphix Jesu mang ayung maq gue ü ngeihleq kum meq ngant.<verse eid="MRK 15:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16" />
  <para style="s">Jesu Gangleq Leihpaq</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Matthew 28.1–8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luke 24.1–12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">John 20.1–10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1" />Mo weq Sabbath lenx, Magdalene ram Mary, James konyuq Mary, geithungteq Salome rammeq Jesu pümtoq raqleq powax thuq nganxmei jie shak. <verse eid="MRK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2" />Hat mao agang paq nüp homxmaq angtan zongq phe goih e kum gunxlungx ka ra. <verse eid="MRK 16:2" /><verse number="3-4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3-4" />Geithuphi Lüm maq kum jaqjaq to aleq, “Kim ginlhakkax Manggom kha to khuppaq longq aoweq laoqleq pha a?” leq günq. (Gaga longqnyuq meilang boh) Gaphaimaq kum meq tuxjux maq longq zap leq ngant. <verse eid="MRK 16:3-4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5" />Gapheimaq Kum manggom kha to zongq, naohan jaq khuqthaoq gunxleq lhakmei lheiqmaq jongleq kum meq ngant geithuphi kum khampungxlop.<verse eid="MRK 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6" />Ku weq, “Nümx khampungxthalop, nümx meq Nazareth mao Jesu ao lakteiq maq kingxleq langxpaq lümq muq lhangga, geithibao ku amaq mant teix, ku gangleq leihtaga! tuxwen, kum meq agamaq ku gue ü ngeih. <verse eid="MRK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:32">Mat 26.32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:28">Mrk 14.28</ref></char></note>Geithibao aleq leihtah geithungteq Peter omleq ko samqsaqram to aga ngaox koh unx, nümx thaoq to ku Galilee to paoxtaga, gama ku weq nümx to beiqyenneq günq gaga unxneq ngantkeo” leq günq.<verse eid="MRK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8" />Gapheimaq kum yux geithungteq manggom manneq phat, chamleixma thibaq koyingx maq kum gax ji khampungxloppoq kum maq teix. Geithungteq aotobix kum meq jajage hagünq, chamleixma thiba kum gax.</para>
  <para style="ms" vid="MRK 16:8">Korangq Roolalx Gaanrangx Komei<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kokao lhakgoxlaiq je korangq labpaq laixmaq aga gaanrangx roolalx mant tei (lhaakpaq 9–20).</char></note></para>
  <para style="mr" vid="MRK 16:8">
    <ref loc="MRK 16:9-20">16.9–20</ref></para>
  <para style="s" vid="MRK 16:8">Magdaleneram Mary Geto Jesu Ngai</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 16:8">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9">Matthew 28.9</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 28:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:11-18">John 20.11–18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 16:8">[ <verse eid="MRK 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9" />Aleq Jesu rixyu manneq gangleq leih phei maq hatmaq agangxpaq nüp, Ku magdalene ram Mary geto agangnga ngai, ao mao konyux lhahboq ananth ngoiye leq ku weq jangxleq paox. <verse eid="MRK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10" />Gaga nya paox geithungteq gaga nya phi goih e haple tiparam kum to günq. <verse eid="MRK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11" />Geithungteq Mojux maq Jesu gangleq leihtataoleq, mihnyu nya e nganttaoleq gaga nya mao kum meq tanx, gaga nya to kum meq koyingxleq hateih.<verse eid="MRK 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Samsaram Anyixge to Jesu Ngai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 24:13-35">Luke 24.13–35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12" />Gapheimaq, Jesu weq samqsaqram anyix nok to pao leq tijux maq amungram nyemxjithonx nanx neq ngai. <verse eid="MRK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13" />Kum nongleq leih geithungteq amungq ram to günq, geithibao gagaram meq kum to koyingxleq hateih.<verse eid="MRK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Samsaram Banxbajaq Geto Ngai</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Matthew 28.16–20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luke 24.36–49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">John 20.19–23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Lümparam 1.6–8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14" />Koka a kum tamx shahleq tijuxmaq samsaram banxbaqjaq geto Jesu ngai, ku weq kum to shih chamleixma thiba kum maq mongoung hateix. Geithungteq ku nganttaoleq günqpaq ram to kummeq koyingxleq hateih e kum mongkea ü leimaq! <verse eid="MRK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:8">Lümp 1.8</ref></char></note>Geithungteq Ku weq kum to, “Kahgannyuq rappoq to paowen, geithungteq khüonyak rappoq to gaanrangx komei nüo leq koh unx. <verse eid="MRK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16" />Aopangngeq koyingxleq teih geithungteq baptixlah gangngaox, geithibao aopangngeq koyingxleq hateih aoxngeih kum to komo koh. <verse eid="MRK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17" />Koyingx teihpaq ram to agapaq halakhaleq kahhonxangmanx gongx koh aox, kum meq ka münx maq konyux kaishih lhasaq kogenq jangxngaox, Kum meq lee renq phi ging ngaox, <verse eid="MRK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18" />Kum lhakmaq pux tamx babe, rix yathuq khunxjie ying babeq, kum to genq nathuq mant tiyaox; kum meq kakpaq ram khüo to lhak phi mak banox, garam kak meiyao” leq günq.<verse eid="MRK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Ang to Zünt</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 24:50-53">Luke 24.50–53</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Lümparam 1.9–11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16.19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Lümp 1.9–11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kum phi Taihungpaq Jesu weq ngaox günq pheimaq ku angtoq lahleq zünx, geithungteq Younggan lhakmei lheiqmaq jong. <verse eid="MRK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20" />Samsaram pao geithungteq pangyungx maq honxnüoq, geithuphi Taihungpa e kumphi monmok. Geithuphi kum to kahhonxangmanx gongx koh ü leimaq kum meq nüopaq to koyingxleq teihleq hox.]</para>
  <para style="ms" vid="MRK 16:20">Laiq Korangq Kokao maq agaunneq Rakkuq Ngantnaox<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kokao lhakgoxlaiq ji korangq labpaq laiq maq aga kotohsaq roolalx mao gaanrangx komei phi heihleq roolalx lüoq wa le tei (lhaakpaq 9–20).</char></note></para>
  <para style="mr" vid="MRK 16:20">
    <ref loc="MRK 16:9-10">16.9–10</ref></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 16:20">[ <verse eid="MRK 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" pubnumber="[9]" sid="MRK 16:21" /> Mihnyu nya ram, Peter geithungteq ko goipaq ram gi to pao, geithungteq kum to günqpaq ram rap yomjithomx leq kum to günq; <verse eid="MRK 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" pubnumber="[10]" sid="MRK 16:22" /> Gapheimaq Jesu weq woleq ko samqsaqram angtan zongq chingq manneq nyip chingq to ngoi ye leq ronx leq thamq paq galomaq haham mathu gangx leq leih paq ngaoxging pongx leq paox.]<verse eid="MRK 16:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16" />
</usx>